<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:04.400" end="00:00:08.000" style="s2">Eyes up, people. The strongest woman on</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.200" end="00:00:09.900" style="s2">the boardwalk is right here. If I make</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.000" end="00:00:12.700" style="s2">your day, scan the tip sign or toss</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.900" end="00:00:12.700" style="s2">something in the jar.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.400" end="00:00:18.100" style="s2">Just my luck. Sweetheart, performing for</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.700" end="00:00:19.700" style="s2">tips? People will think I threw you out.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.100" end="00:00:21.200" style="s2">Of course not. You only pulled my</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.700" end="00:00:23.600" style="s2">tuition, cut me off, and changed the</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.200" end="00:00:25.700" style="s2">locks. Totally different.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.600" end="00:00:28.900" style="s2">Still sharp. Come with me. I brought you</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.700" end="00:00:28.900" style="s2">good news. Pass.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.100" end="00:00:33.300" style="s2">Then keep passing on the chance to find</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.700" end="00:00:35.900" style="s2">your children. If you want to know where</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.300" end="00:00:38.600" style="s2">they are, you&#39;ll do exactly what I say.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.900" end="00:00:38.600" style="s2">My children.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.265" end="00:00:45.250" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.230" end="00:00:45.250" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.100" end="00:00:52.500" style="s2">You took them?</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.400" end="00:00:55.800" style="s2">I arranged it. And I&#39;m still the only</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.500" end="00:00:57.700" style="s2">person who can lead you to them.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.800" end="00:00:59.900" style="s2">Careful. Hurt me and the trail dies with</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.700" end="00:00:59.900" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.600" end="00:01:04.699" style="s2">What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.800" end="00:01:06.400" style="s2">Marry Ethan Cole. The man Sabrina was</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.699" end="00:01:08.400" style="s2">supposed to marry. The single dad your</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.400" end="00:01:10.700" style="s2">family keeps calling broken disfigured.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.400" end="00:01:12.200" style="s2">He has no money and he has two kids. My</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.700" end="00:01:14.000" style="s2">daughter deserves better. I&#39;m your</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.200" end="00:01:15.400" style="s2">daughter, too.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.000" end="00:01:17.400" style="s2">You know what I mean. So you want me to</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.400" end="00:01:19.300" style="s2">take Sabrina&#39;s place?</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.400" end="00:01:21.900" style="s2">Marry him and you get the full file. Do</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.300" end="00:01:21.900" style="s2">we have a deal?</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.300" end="00:01:27.300" style="s2">If that&#39;s your price,</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.900" end="00:01:27.300" style="s2">fine. I&#39;ll marry him.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.800" end="00:01:39.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, why do we look like we lost a fight</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.600" end="00:01:41.200" style="s2">with a thrift store? Because dad&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.300" end="00:01:42.600" style="s2">testing his bride. If she only sees</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.200" end="00:01:43.800" style="s2">money, better to know before the</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.600" end="00:01:45.700" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.800" end="00:01:48.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She could be your new mom.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.700" end="00:01:48.600" style="s2">Nobody blows our cover.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.200" end="00:01:53.300" style="s2">When the Coles were down, the Hales</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.800" end="00:01:54.600" style="s2">didn&#39;t just turn their backs. They made</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.300" end="00:01:56.700" style="s2">things worse.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.600" end="00:01:57.900" style="s2">I built Apex Meridian without them. Now</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.700" end="00:02:01.392" style="s2">they expect me to go through with that</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.900" end="00:02:02.692" style="s2">marriage. I want who I&#39;m marrying first.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.392" end="00:02:03.492" style="s2">So,</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.692" end="00:02:06.992" style="s2">am I wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.492" end="00:02:08.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re being careful. That&#39;s not wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.992" end="00:02:10.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And stay in character.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.692" end="00:02:11.892" style="s2">She can&#39;t know I have money or that the</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.692" end="00:02:16.292" style="s2">scar comes off.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.892" end="00:02:16.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. Your secret&#39;s safe with us.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.692" end="00:02:25.092" style="s2">Leo,</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.792" end="00:02:26.392" style="s2">do we really have to pretend we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.092" end="00:02:30.092" style="s2">broke?</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.392" end="00:02:32.292" style="s2">Unless you want a stranger showing up</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.092" end="00:02:34.892" style="s2">and becoming our new mom.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.292" end="00:02:34.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.792" end="00:02:46.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So much for the hideous fiancee.</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.292" end="00:02:52.292" style="s2">And I take that back.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.492" end="00:03:06.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom. Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.392" end="00:03:06.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom?</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.892" end="00:03:17.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you calling me mom?</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.392" end="00:03:19.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you are. Lily and I see you in</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.192" end="00:03:20.492" style="s2">our dreams all the time.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.592" end="00:03:22.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You see me?</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.492" end="00:03:23.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re in a hospital. Everything&#39;s white</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.292" end="00:03:25.392" style="s2">and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.292" end="00:03:27.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Mara Quinn. I&#39;m Ethan Cole. No</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.392" end="00:03:28.592" style="s2">house, one dying car and this face. But</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.392" end="00:03:29.892" style="s2">I still want a wife who&#39;s gorgeous,</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.592" end="00:03:32.392" style="s2">sweet, polished and knows her way around</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.892" end="00:03:34.392" style="s2">a kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.392" end="00:03:35.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarred, broke and picky. Bold</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.392" end="00:03:37.792" style="s2">combination.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.892" end="00:03:39.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ignore the sales pitch. Dad&#39;s actually</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.792" end="00:03:41.492" style="s2">great. He&#39;ll take care of you and if you</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.492" end="00:03:43.292" style="s2">say jump, he&#39;ll ask how high.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.492" end="00:03:44.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.292" end="00:03:46.692" style="s2">We agreed the broken scarred act would</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.892" end="00:03:47.292" style="s2">scare her off. Why are you selling me</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.692" end="00:03:50.692" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.292" end="00:03:50.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never said the bride was mom.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.692" end="00:03:57.092" style="s2">Dad has a lot going for him, but his</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.492" end="00:03:57.992" style="s2">best feature?</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.092" end="00:03:59.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.992" end="00:04:01.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He comes with two ridiculously adorable</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.792" end="00:04:02.692" style="s2">kids. Marry him and we&#39;re a package</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.592" end="00:04:02.894" style="s2">deal.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.692" end="00:04:04.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.894" end="00:04:06.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole, don&#39;t listen to him. I&#39;m broke,</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.994" end="00:04:07.994" style="s2">I&#39;m scarred, and marrying me means a</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.594" end="00:04:09.094" style="s2">lifetime of trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.994" end="00:04:10.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.094" end="00:04:12.094" style="s2">Let&#39;s get the marriage license.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.294" end="00:04:13.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.094" end="00:04:14.994" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.194" end="00:04:17.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like [music] the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.994" end="00:04:19.094" style="s2">If you want this too, let&#39;s do it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.794" end="00:04:21.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t even have my ID on me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.094" end="00:04:21.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah packed it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.694" end="00:04:25.494" style="s2">We brought it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.294" end="00:04:40.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just married a man I barely know.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.394" end="00:04:41.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Regretting it already?</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.494" end="00:04:43.694" style="s2">Say the word and we&#39;ll handle the</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.894" end="00:04:45.094" style="s2">separation properly.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.694" end="00:04:46.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not leaving. Marriage wasn&#39;t the</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.094" end="00:04:48.094" style="s2">point.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.494" end="00:04:49.694" style="s2">Finding my children is</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.094" end="00:04:52.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, dad&#39;s actually</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.694" end="00:04:52.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.394" end="00:04:57.794" style="s2">What was our deal?</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.194" end="00:04:59.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said the broken scarred act would</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.794" end="00:05:02.194" style="s2">make mom walk away.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.594" end="00:05:03.394" style="s2">You&#39;re married now. Why keep lying?</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.194" end="00:05:05.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Being married doesn&#39;t mean I trust her</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.394" end="00:05:06.294" style="s2">yet.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.194" end="00:05:07.194" style="s2">We might still decide this was a</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.294" end="00:05:08.794" style="s2">mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.194" end="00:05:10.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not leaving mom.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.794" end="00:05:11.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When the Coles were struggling, the</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.594" end="00:05:13.194" style="s2">Hales kicked [music] us while we were</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.794" end="00:05:14.894" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.194" end="00:05:16.694" style="s2">What if she&#39;s here for something?</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.894" end="00:05:18.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom had nothing to do with what her</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.694" end="00:05:20.994" style="s2">family did back then.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.694" end="00:05:24.294" style="s2">If she&#39;s giving us a chance now, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.994" end="00:05:24.294" style="s2">because she wants to.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.094" end="00:05:28.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, hey. What happened? Tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.894" end="00:05:32.794" style="s2">I&#39;ll fix it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.994" end="00:05:32.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want you to leave mom.</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.194" end="00:05:40.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Okay. I won&#39;t walk away. Not now.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.394" end="00:05:42.494" style="s2">But we make a deal.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.894" end="00:05:43.894" style="s2">You keep the money and the scar between</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.494" end="00:05:45.994" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.894" end="00:05:48.894" style="s2">I keep trying.</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.994" end="00:05:51.194" style="s2">No promises beyond that.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.894" end="00:05:53.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal?</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.194" end="00:05:53.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.994" end="00:05:58.994" style="s2">She won&#39;t stay with a broke man with a</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.494" end="00:06:02.694" style="s2">scar forever.</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.994" end="00:06:02.694" style="s2">Leo and Lily will see I was right.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.394" end="00:06:07.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.694" end="00:06:07.795" style="s2">What are you three whispering about?</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.095" end="00:06:11.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.995" end="00:06:12.495" style="s2">So,</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.395" end="00:06:13.354" style="s2">the kids and I are staying at your place</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.495" end="00:06:13.895" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.354" end="00:06:15.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.895" end="00:06:17.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My place?</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.895" end="00:06:19.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m unemployed, remember? I can&#39;t afford</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.995" end="00:06:20.495" style="s2">rent. Where else would we go?</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.495" end="00:06:22.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.495" end="00:06:23.895" style="s2">You pay half the rent.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.595" end="00:06:24.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re married. Do we really need to</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.895" end="00:06:27.295" style="s2">split every bill?</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.995" end="00:06:30.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Roommates split bills. Strangers who</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.295" end="00:06:31.495" style="s2">just got married definitely do.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.295" end="00:06:34.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.495" end="00:06:34.195" style="s2">I have no money.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.995" end="00:06:39.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily and I are sleeping on the sidewalk</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.295" end="00:06:41.574" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.554" end="00:06:41.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.995" end="00:06:44.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. All right. You two can stay</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.895" end="00:06:47.895" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.695" end="00:06:47.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She [music] actually said yes.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.695" end="00:06:55.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is it. It&#39;s small, but we can make</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.495" end="00:06:55.095" style="s2">room for four.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.295" end="00:07:06.195" style="s2">Ethan, write up a resume. I&#39;ll ask</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.695" end="00:07:08.595" style="s2">around and find out who&#39;s hiring. When</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.195" end="00:07:10.195" style="s2">something opens up, you take it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.595" end="00:07:11.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A job?</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.195" end="00:07:13.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.495" end="00:07:14.695" style="s2">Raising kids costs money.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.195" end="00:07:16.695" style="s2">Preschool for two can swallow most of a</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.695" end="00:07:18.695" style="s2">paycheck. I can&#39;t carry all four of us</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.695" end="00:07:19.895" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.695" end="00:07:20.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d pay for their school?</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.895" end="00:07:22.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.995" end="00:07:24.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re not yours.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.695" end="00:07:27.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I married you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.195" end="00:07:27.495" style="s2">Your kids are my family now, too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.795" end="00:07:30.895" style="s2">Go pick something to watch. Mom&#39;s making</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.295" end="00:07:33.295" style="s2">dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.895" end="00:07:35.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll help. Me, too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.295" end="00:07:38.095" style="s2">I&#39;ll wash the celery. I get the</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.295" end="00:07:38.095" style="s2">tomatoes.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.125" end="00:07:43.145" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.995" end="00:07:52.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dinner&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.495" end="00:08:01.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, try a rib. You need some meat on</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.495" end="00:08:02.895" style="s2">you. And have some soup.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.095" end="00:08:04.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re such good kids.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.895" end="00:08:08.495" style="s2">I just wish they were mine.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.995" end="00:08:08.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what happened? You look sad.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.495" end="00:08:10.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.797" end="00:08:11.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; happened. Mom&#39;s fine. Now you two eat</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.497" end="00:08:12.897" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.297" end="00:08:14.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two are forgetting someone?</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.897" end="00:08:15.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want some too? You&#39;ve got hands,</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.597" end="00:08:17.997" style="s2">dad.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.297" end="00:08:17.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.497" end="00:08:21.797" style="s2">Naturally.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.697" end="00:08:23.297" style="s2">But there is something I&#39;ve been meaning</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.797" end="00:08:24.397" style="s2">to ask you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.297" end="00:08:27.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.397" end="00:08:28.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m broke, scarred, and raising twins.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.197" end="00:08:31.297" style="s2">Why did you marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.997" end="00:08:32.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marriage is a partnership. I needed one</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.297" end="00:08:33.697" style="s2">and you seem decent. The rest doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.897" end="00:08:35.197" style="s2">matter to me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.697" end="00:08:36.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what do you think of me so far?</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.197" end="00:08:40.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re decent. A little too comfortable</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.997" end="00:08:40.297" style="s2">eating my food without a job.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.697" end="00:08:45.297" style="s2">Who is this?</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.097" end="00:08:47.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.297" end="00:08:50.397" style="s2">I married Ethan just like you demanded.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.897" end="00:08:52.597" style="s2">Now tell me where my children are.</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.397" end="00:08:54.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.597" end="00:08:55.497" style="s2">Vanessa Hale,</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.097" end="00:08:58.097" style="s2">you know what happens when I lose</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.497" end="00:08:58.097" style="s2">patience.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.416" end="00:09:00.597" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.097" end="00:09:02.397" style="s2">What&#39;s the rush?</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.597" end="00:09:05.397" style="s2">Give me a few days. I&#39;ll tell you where</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.397" end="00:09:05.397" style="s2">they are when I&#39;m ready.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.997" end="00:09:17.397" style="s2">They actually fit.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.797" end="00:09:18.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You live alone. Why do you have kids&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.397" end="00:09:20.797" style="s2">pajamas?</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.897" end="00:09:22.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I bought them for my twins. They&#39;d be</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.797" end="00:09:24.497" style="s2">about Leo and Lily&#39;s age now, but</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.397" end="00:09:26.197" style="s2">they&#39;re not here to wear them.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.497" end="00:09:27.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I shouldn&#39;t have brought it</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.197" end="00:09:29.197" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.497" end="00:09:30.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay. You and the kids take my</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.197" end="00:09:33.097" style="s2">room. I&#39;ll sleep in the other one.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.397" end="00:09:34.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, can Leo and I sleep with you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.097" end="00:09:36.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.397" end="00:09:37.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, don&#39;t you like sleeping with dad</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.497" end="00:09:39.497" style="s2">anymore?</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.197" end="00:09:40.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you, dad. I just want mom more</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.497" end="00:09:44.297" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.897" end="00:09:44.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then maybe the kids can sleep with me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.897" end="00:09:54.897" style="s2">Leo, Lily, breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.797" end="00:09:56.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One thing.</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.897" end="00:09:58.397" style="s2">I have a job interview today. Can you</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.697" end="00:09:59.897" style="s2">watch the kids?</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.397" end="00:10:01.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve known each other for one day and</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.897" end="00:10:03.397" style="s2">you&#39;re leaving your kids with me? What</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.597" end="00:10:04.797" style="s2">if I&#39;m a kidnapper?</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.397" end="00:10:07.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not worried.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.797" end="00:10:07.897" style="s2">Lily can protect her brother.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.598" end="00:10:22.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, Mr. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.698" end="00:10:28.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I leave town for a few days and you get</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.698" end="00:10:29.898" style="s2">married? [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.798" end="00:10:31.398" style="s2">What&#39;s she like?</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.898" end="00:10:32.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s all right. She&#39;s good to Leo and</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.398" end="00:10:33.598" style="s2">Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.098" end="00:10:35.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor Lawson invited you to the Lawson</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.598" end="00:10:36.298" style="s2">Hotel&#39;s gala tonight. Should I accept?</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.498" end="00:10:37.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Accept it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.298" end="00:10:39.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.098" end="00:10:39.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.998" end="00:10:43.298" style="s2">Have HR put me through the regular</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.498" end="00:10:45.598" style="s2">onboarding for a lobby security job.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.298" end="00:10:47.598" style="s2">Background check, training, all of it. I</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.598" end="00:10:49.798" style="s2">need a job I can actually show up for.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.598" end="00:10:52.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A security job for you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.798" end="00:10:52.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard me. [music] Go.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.698" end="00:10:57.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You married a man you&#39;d met once and one</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.498" end="00:10:59.298" style="s2">who was not exactly easy on the eyes?</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.698" end="00:11:01.098" style="s2">What choice did I have? Vanessa used my</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.298" end="00:11:03.698" style="s2">children&#39;s whereabouts to force me into</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.098" end="00:11:05.298" style="s2">it. Vanessa is vile. If I see her, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.698" end="00:11:07.398" style="s2">forget her. You asked me to find you</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.298" end="00:11:09.898" style="s2">work, right? Lawson Hotels need event</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.398" end="00:11:12.798" style="s2">servers tonight. $250 for the shift.</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.898" end="00:11:16.298" style="s2">250? Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.798" end="00:11:16.298" style="s2">Hey, husband. Are you free tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.698" end="00:11:20.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Husband?</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.098" end="00:11:20.898" style="s2">I have plans tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.498" end="00:11:26.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it important?</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.298" end="00:11:26.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.698" end="00:11:29.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.898" end="00:11:30.898" style="s2">My husband has something important</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.298" end="00:11:33.898" style="s2">tonight, so he can&#39;t take the kids. I</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.898" end="00:11:33.898" style="s2">can&#39;t work the gala.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.098" end="00:11:38.598" style="s2">The staffing agency arranged a kids&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.598" end="00:11:39.798" style="s2">room with a sitter. Bring them along.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.598" end="00:11:42.198" style="s2">There&#39;ll be plenty of security at the</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.798" end="00:11:42.198" style="s2">gala.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.498" end="00:11:47.498" style="s2">Stay here and have fun.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.998" end="00:11:48.598" style="s2">I &#39;ll come get you when my shift ends,</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.498" end="00:11:51.698" style="s2">okay?</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.598" end="00:11:51.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.498" end="00:12:00.798" style="s2">Didn&#39;t Mom say to stay here?</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.598" end="00:12:02.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom just doesn&#39;t want us wandering off.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.798" end="00:12:04.698" style="s2">She&#39;s worried someone might take us.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.998" end="00:12:05.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But we&#39;re not scared of kidnappers, are</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.698" end="00:12:09.498" style="s2">we?</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.398" end="00:12:13.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. If anyone tries, I &#39;ll hit them.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.498" end="00:12:15.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The CEO of Apex Meridian is coming.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.399" end="00:12:17.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The CEO of Apex Meridian? He&#39;s one of</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.999" end="00:12:20.199" style="s2">the richest men in the country.</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.799" end="00:12:23.599" style="s2">Come on. If he notices us, we might</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.199" end="00:12:23.599" style="s2">never have to carry another tray.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.999" end="00:12:30.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome, Mr. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.299" end="00:12:34.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan?</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.599" end="00:12:43.899" style="s2">Mara, do you know the CEO of Apex</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.799" end="00:12:45.699" style="s2">Meridian?</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.899" end="00:12:47.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. From the side he looked a little</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.699" end="00:12:48.599" style="s2">like my husband,</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.099" end="00:12:49.599" style="s2">but only from the side. My husband isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.599" end="00:12:50.599" style="s2">that handsome.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.599" end="00:12:52.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And here I thought I was about to become</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.599" end="00:12:53.699" style="s2">best friends with a billionaire&#39;s wife.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.199" end="00:12:54.999" style="s2">Guess I&#39;m still working for a living.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.699" end="00:12:57.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry I failed to marry a</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.999" end="00:12:59.299" style="s2">billionaire and finance your retirement.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.699" end="00:13:03.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re impossible. Come on, before the</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.299" end="00:13:05.199" style="s2">supervisor catches us standing around.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.099" end="00:13:07.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was close. But what is she doing</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.199" end="00:13:07.499" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.799" end="00:13:10.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cole, do you know that [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.399" end="00:13:11.999" style="s2">server?</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.699" end="00:13:14.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.999" end="00:13:18.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He obviously knows her. Why pretend he</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.099" end="00:13:18.299" style="s2">doesn&#39;t? I&#39;ll never understand that man.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.599" end="00:13:26.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is what a Lawson Hotels gala</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.299" end="00:13:28.099" style="s2">looks like. It&#39;s gorgeous. Thank you,</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.599" end="00:13:28.934" style="s2">Brandon. I&#39;d never get a glimpse of this</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.099" end="00:13:29.199" style="s2">world without you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.934" end="00:13:31.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.199" end="00:13:33.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you can thank me properly tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.199" end="00:13:35.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re so bad.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.599" end="00:13:37.299" style="s2">Wait, [music] isn&#39;t that Mara?</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.799" end="00:13:38.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already dumped her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.299" end="00:13:41.299" style="s2">Did she take a serving job just to</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.599" end="00:13:41.299" style="s2">follow me here?</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.899" end="00:13:48.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect. Of all the people in Los</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.699" end="00:13:48.299" style="s2">Angeles, I had to run into these two.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.999" end="00:13:56.999" style="s2">Sabrina, your stepsister, and Brandon,</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.999" end="00:14:00.099" style="s2">your ex, those two are together now?</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.999" end="00:14:00.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re not worth it. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.599" end="00:14:04.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, why are you running off? I was</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.599" end="00:14:06.299" style="s2">going to ask why you&#39;re serving tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.299" end="00:14:09.099" style="s2">Are you short on money?</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.299" end="00:14:09.799" style="s2">You could have called me. I&#39;d help.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.099" end="00:14:12.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.799" end="00:14:13.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. You&#39;re my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.299" end="00:14:15.601" style="s2">Watching you carry trays and wait on</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.799" end="00:14:17.301" style="s2">people breaks my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.601" end="00:14:18.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina, you&#39;re too kind.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.301" end="00:14:18.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brendan.</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.059" end="00:14:19.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.101" end="00:14:21.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.301" end="00:14:24.101" style="s2">Since you&#39;re so generous, start with</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.101" end="00:14:24.101" style="s2">$25,000.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.701" end="00:14:29.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 25,000? I don&#39;t have that kind of money.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.501" end="00:14:31.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No? [music] Fine. Give me whatever you</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.201" end="00:14:31.601" style="s2">have.</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.001" end="00:14:35.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing? That&#39;s robbery.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.501" end="00:14:37.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Robbery?</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.901" end="00:14:39.001" style="s2">You just said you wanted to help.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.401" end="00:14:41.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do, but you can&#39;t demand $20 or</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.001" end="00:14:43.301" style="s2">$30,000. Who can afford that?</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.601" end="00:14:45.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad set aside that money for my tuition</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.301" end="00:14:46.401" style="s2">and living expenses. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.001" end="00:14:47.601" style="s2">It disappeared after your mother moved</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.401" end="00:14:50.001" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.601" end="00:14:52.501" style="s2">That bag costs thousands. [music] Did</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.001" end="00:14:55.601" style="s2">you buy it with my college fund?</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.501" end="00:14:57.001" style="s2">This? It&#39;s a knockoff.</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.601" end="00:15:00.301" style="s2">By the way, I heard you got married</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.001" end="00:15:00.301" style="s2">right after Brendan left you for me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.801" end="00:15:05.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara got married?</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.801" end="00:15:05.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She did. And wait until you see him.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.501" end="00:15:12.201" style="s2">This is Mara&#39;s husband, Ethan Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.001" end="00:15:14.001" style="s2">What? Am I wrong? Look at that scar.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.201" end="00:15:16.301" style="s2">Here, everyone, take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.001" end="00:15:17.601" style="s2">That scar is rough.</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.301" end="00:15:19.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone married him?</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.601" end="00:15:20.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That photo can&#39;t be flattering. His face</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.201" end="00:15:23.501" style="s2">looks wrecked.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.301" end="00:15:25.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why marry a man who looks like that?</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.501" end="00:15:27.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Money? What else? Turn off the lights</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.801" end="00:15:31.201" style="s2">and it won&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.701" end="00:15:31.201" style="s2">Enough, all of you.</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.201" end="00:15:37.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re bullying Mom. Lily, come on.</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.701" end="00:15:39.601" style="s2">We&#39;re helping her. Dad, are you coming?</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.201" end="00:15:41.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina Hale is her stepsister?</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.601" end="00:15:44.001" style="s2">Is that why the Hales sent Mara instead?</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.801" end="00:15:45.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, Lily. If Dad won&#39;t go, we will.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.001" end="00:15:46.901" style="s2">Dad, Dad, I&#39;m not talking to you</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.701" end="00:15:49.501" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.901" end="00:15:50.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said I wasn&#39;t going?</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.501" end="00:15:53.901" style="s2">Mara,</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.801" end="00:15:56.401" style="s2">how could you do this to yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.901" end="00:15:57.401" style="s2">Marrying a man everyone laughs at?</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.401" end="00:15:59.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.401" end="00:16:02.601" style="s2">The confidence of a mediocre man. Have</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.601" end="00:16:02.601" style="s2">you always been like this?</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.401" end="00:16:06.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.801" end="00:16:07.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brendan, don&#39;t take it personally. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.001" end="00:16:08.801" style="s2">miserable about her husband, so she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.401" end="00:16:10.601" style="s2">lashing out.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.801" end="00:16:11.401" style="s2">Mara, you can&#39;t dump your unhappiness on</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.601" end="00:16:14.801" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.401" end="00:16:14.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s laughing at my dad?</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.402" end="00:16:27.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.302" end="00:16:27.702" style="s2">But Ethan has a scar.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.702" end="00:16:37.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.702" end="00:16:40.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Leo Cole. This is my sister Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.802" end="00:16:42.202" style="s2">and this is our dad, Ethan Cole. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.202" end="00:16:44.902" style="s2">married to my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.202" end="00:16:46.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is he this handsome?</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.902" end="00:16:47.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Ethan Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.402" end="00:16:50.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said your husband wasn&#39;t exactly</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.702" end="00:16:52.102" style="s2">handsome. I don&#39;t understand.</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.202" end="00:16:55.102" style="s2">He looked completely different before.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.102" end="00:16:56.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who called my dad ugly? Step forward.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.102" end="00:16:59.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did. So what?</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.802" end="00:17:03.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then open your eyes. Look at my dad. Now</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.402" end="00:17:03.502" style="s2">look at Brandon. Who&#39;s the ugly one?</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.202" end="00:17:08.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No contest. Ethan is far better looking.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.302" end="00:17:09.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That photo had to be fake. He looks</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.402" end="00:17:11.402" style="s2">nothing like it. If the photo was fake,</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.902" end="00:17:13.002" style="s2">maybe the rest was too. Maybe the</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.402" end="00:17:15.566" style="s2">stepsister stole Mara&#39;s boyfriend and</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.002" end="00:17:16.702" style="s2">rewrote the story.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.566" end="00:17:18.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.702" end="00:17:20.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all your fault, you little</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.102" end="00:17:21.802" style="s2">bastard.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.302" end="00:17:22.302" style="s2">Leo, are you hurt? Tell me where it</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.802" end="00:17:26.202" style="s2">hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.302" end="00:17:26.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m okay, mom. Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.902" end="00:17:29.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re shoving kids now, Sabrina? How</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.502" end="00:17:32.502" style="s2">low can you go?</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.502" end="00:17:32.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He deserved it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.902" end="00:17:37.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need an ambulance. A child was pushed</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.602" end="00:17:40.502" style="s2">to the floor in the Lawson Hotel</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.902" end="00:17:40.502" style="s2">ballroom.</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.302" end="00:17:46.002" style="s2">You called 911 over one little shove.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.702" end="00:17:48.702" style="s2">You&#39;re [music] pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.002" end="00:17:51.002" style="s2">The paramedics are for Leo.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.702" end="00:17:53.902" style="s2">The police are for you. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.002" end="00:17:55.402" style="s2">What are you doing, Brandon? Stop her.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.902" end="00:17:57.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, for my sake.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.402" end="00:17:59.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve wanted to do that for years. And</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.502" end="00:18:01.202" style="s2">stop telling people you dumped me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.602" end="00:18:02.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I caught you cheating with Sabrina, so I</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.202" end="00:18:05.502" style="s2">ended it. You&#39;ve been lying about our</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.902" end="00:18:07.502" style="s2">breakup ever since.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.502" end="00:18:08.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is wrong with you? I&#39;m your sister.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.502" end="00:18:10.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stepsister.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.802" end="00:18:12.102" style="s2">Your mom had an affair with my dad then</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.302" end="00:18:14.002" style="s2">moved into our home. My mother never</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.102" end="00:18:15.302" style="s2">recovered, and I haven&#39;t forgotten any</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.002" end="00:18:18.502" style="s2">of it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.302" end="00:18:18.502" style="s2">Dad will make you pay for this.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.002" end="00:18:25.202" style="s2">Security!</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.102" end="00:18:25.202" style="s2">Help!</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.603" end="00:18:28.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry about the scene. Family drama.</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.603" end="00:18:30.203" style="s2">Please enjoy the rest of the gala.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.903" end="00:18:32.603" style="s2">Security can take it from here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.203" end="00:18:32.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.203" end="00:18:40.703" style="s2">What is going on?</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.103" end="00:18:42.403" style="s2">I hosted this gala to welcome Mr. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.703" end="00:18:45.703" style="s2">If this spectacle reaches him, everyone</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.403" end="00:18:45.703" style="s2">responsible is out.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.543" end="00:18:53.403" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.203" end="00:18:54.703" style="s2">Mr. Lawson.</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.403" end="00:18:55.903" style="s2">And you are?</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.703" end="00:18:58.003" style="s2">Brandon Shaw.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.903" end="00:18:59.003" style="s2">My father runs Shaw Development. We met</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.003" end="00:19:01.403" style="s2">here when you had a business meeting</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.003" end="00:19:03.203" style="s2">with my father. Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.403" end="00:19:04.603" style="s2">Right.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.203" end="00:19:05.703" style="s2">So you decided to start a fight at my</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.603" end="00:19:07.003" style="s2">gala?</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.703" end="00:19:08.403" style="s2">Give me one reason security shouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.003" end="00:19:10.803" style="s2">remove you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.403" end="00:19:12.003" style="s2">I didn&#39;t start anything. She did.</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.803" end="00:19:13.468" style="s2">She begged me to take her back. I</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.003" end="00:19:13.903" style="s2">refused and she went crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.468" end="00:19:15.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.903" end="00:19:16.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brandon, you could make a career out of</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.203" end="00:19:18.303" style="s2">twisting the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.403" end="00:19:20.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s telling the truth. Mr. Lawson, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.303" end="00:19:21.603" style="s2">her sister. I should be defending her,</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.003" end="00:19:23.103" style="s2">but she went too far. I have to be</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.603" end="00:19:24.903" style="s2">honest.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.103" end="00:19:26.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You struck a guest at my gala. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.903" end="00:19:28.603" style="s2">Everyone involved stays here until I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.303" end="00:19:29.903" style="s2">seen the footage and the police arrive.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.603" end="00:19:31.403" style="s2">Keep her here. Preserve the ballroom</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.903" end="00:19:33.503" style="s2">footage.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.403" end="00:19:34.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody touches mom.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.503" end="00:19:34.903" style="s2">Nobody.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.303" end="00:19:37.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch them.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.903" end="00:19:37.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.003" end="00:19:40.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who are</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.303" end="00:19:44.703" style="s2">Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.203" end="00:19:47.603" style="s2">Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.903" end="00:19:54.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.903" end="00:19:57.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cole is here?</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.603" end="00:19:58.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where? I don&#39;t see him.</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.103" end="00:20:00.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Right.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.903" end="00:20:01.603" style="s2">I was wondering why Mr. Cole still</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.403" end="00:20:03.403" style="s2">hasn&#39;t arrived. That&#39;s that&#39;s what I</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.603" end="00:20:05.703" style="s2">meant. Now, where were we? I&#39;d like to</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.403" end="00:20:07.403" style="s2">file a complaint.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.703" end="00:20:10.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A complaint about what?</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.403" end="00:20:11.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those two harassed my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.003" end="00:20:13.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They harassed your wife?</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.303" end="00:20:15.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife was doing her job.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.103" end="00:20:16.603" style="s2">They mocked my face, humiliated her, and</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.303" end="00:20:18.903" style="s2">then Sabrina shoved our son to the</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.603" end="00:20:18.903" style="s2">floor.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.303" end="00:20:23.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She pushed my my down.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.505" end="00:20:29.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Lawson,</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.105" end="00:20:30.505" style="s2">everyone says you&#39;re fair.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.305" end="00:20:32.105" style="s2">I&#39;m sure you&#39;ll review the footage and</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.505" end="00:20:34.705" style="s2">handle this properly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.105" end="00:20:37.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please handle it fairly, Mr. Lawson.</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.705" end="00:20:37.205" style="s2">Fairly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.805" end="00:20:42.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Lawson,</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.105" end="00:20:43.905" style="s2">that&#39;s not what happened. I never</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.805" end="00:20:45.005" style="s2">Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.905" end="00:20:46.805" style="s2">Security,</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.005" end="00:20:48.105" style="s2">escort them out of the ballroom.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.805" end="00:20:51.305" style="s2">Save all the security footage and give</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.105" end="00:20:51.305" style="s2">it to the police when they arrive.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.705" end="00:20:54.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let security handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.405" end="00:20:57.705" style="s2">This stopped being a family matter when</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.705" end="00:20:57.705" style="s2">she shoved a child.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.405" end="00:21:06.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you were amazing tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.305" end="00:21:07.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I go too far tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.005" end="00:21:09.305" style="s2">You don&#39;t hate me for it, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.405" end="00:21:13.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Mom. You stopped them because they</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.305" end="00:21:13.505" style="s2">hurt us. We love you even more now.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.705" end="00:21:16.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good, because I</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.605" end="00:21:18.105" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.905" end="00:21:19.305" style="s2">You said you had something important</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.105" end="00:21:20.305" style="s2">tonight. Why were you at the Lawson</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.305" end="00:21:22.305" style="s2">gala?</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.305" end="00:21:24.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you I had an interview.</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.305" end="00:21:26.005" style="s2">I got hired to drive an executive.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.605" end="00:21:28.105" style="s2">He attended the gala, so I drove him</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.005" end="00:21:31.019" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.105" end="00:21:31.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got the job? What does it pay?</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.019" end="00:21:32.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.305" end="00:21:34.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m supposed to be broke.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.905" end="00:21:36.305" style="s2">Better keep the number modest.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.905" end="00:21:40.305" style="s2">5,000 a month.</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.305" end="00:21:41.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5,000? Executive drivers make that much?</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.305" end="00:21:42.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that a lot?</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.505" end="00:21:44.405" style="s2">Maybe rich people don&#39;t care what things</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.905" end="00:21:46.205" style="s2">cost.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.405" end="00:21:48.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s how it works.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.205" end="00:21:50.305" style="s2">The poor keep scrambling</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.105" end="00:21:51.505" style="s2">and the rich barely notice the cost.</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.305" end="00:21:52.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As my wife, aren&#39;t you going to ask what</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.505" end="00:21:53.805" style="s2">happened to my face?</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.705" end="00:21:56.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.805" end="00:21:57.705" style="s2">But first I have to deal with my dad.</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.305" end="00:21:59.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father?</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.705" end="00:22:00.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every time Sabrina and I fight, dad</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.305" end="00:22:02.405" style="s2">takes her side.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.905" end="00:22:04.905" style="s2">By now he&#39;s probably waiting outside my</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.405" end="00:22:04.905" style="s2">front door.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.305" end="00:22:13.205" style="s2">Dad, I know she&#39;s my sister and I should</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.705" end="00:22:15.105" style="s2">let things go, but she attacked Brendan</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.205" end="00:22:17.105" style="s2">and me at the Lawson gala.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.105" end="00:22:18.505" style="s2">She humiliated him so badly he almost</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.105" end="00:22:20.605" style="s2">broke up with me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.505" end="00:22:21.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara went too far this time.</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.605" end="00:22:23.305" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.705" end="00:22:26.206" style="s2">I&#39;ll make sure she answers for it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.305" end="00:22:27.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe let it go. She&#39;s still my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.206" end="00:22:28.806" style="s2">No matter what she does, I should</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.706" end="00:22:30.606" style="s2">forgive her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.806" end="00:22:32.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re too soft-hearted. That&#39;s why she</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.606" end="00:22:35.706" style="s2">keeps bullying you. This time I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.206" end="00:22:35.706" style="s2">standing up for you. Goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.706" end="00:22:45.306" style="s2">Mara Quinn,</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.206" end="00:22:46.706" style="s2">why did you attack Sabrina?</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.306" end="00:22:47.906" style="s2">What could your own sister have done to</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.706" end="00:22:50.206" style="s2">deserve that?</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.906" end="00:22:51.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa told me Mara agreed to this.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.206" end="00:22:53.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I&#39;m not so sure.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.406" end="00:22:55.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, please. We&#39;re standing outside.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.606" end="00:22:57.406" style="s2">Let&#39;s go in and talk calmly.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.806" end="00:22:58.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you? And why are you with my</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.406" end="00:23:01.106" style="s2">daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.506" end="00:23:03.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan Cole, your legal son-in-law. Leo,</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.106" end="00:23:04.306" style="s2">Lily, say hello to your grandfather.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.206" end="00:23:05.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.306" end="00:23:07.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, Grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.406" end="00:23:08.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan Cole,</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.006" end="00:23:10.106" style="s2">wasn&#39;t Sabrina supposed to marry you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.906" end="00:23:12.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara,</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.106" end="00:23:13.206" style="s2">you stole your sister&#39;s fiancé?</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.106" end="00:23:14.706" style="s2">Since you were children, you&#39;ve always</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.206" end="00:23:17.206" style="s2">taken what belongs to her. Now you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.706" end="00:23:18.806" style="s2">taking men too?</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.206" end="00:23:20.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same old story.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.806" end="00:23:21.206" style="s2">You blame me before you even hear the</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.006" end="00:23:22.306" style="s2">facts.</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.206" end="00:23:24.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your tone.</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.306" end="00:23:25.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the tone you get.</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.206" end="00:23:28.206" style="s2">Listen carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.806" end="00:23:30.406" style="s2">Sabrina thought Ethan was poor, scarred,</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.206" end="00:23:32.306" style="s2">and burdened with twins. She refused</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.406" end="00:23:33.806" style="s2">him. Vanessa used my missing children&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.306" end="00:23:35.906" style="s2">whereabouts to force me to take her</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.806" end="00:23:39.806" style="s2">place and marry him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.906" end="00:23:41.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poor, yes. But scarred? Look at him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.806" end="00:23:43.306" style="s2">Vanessa found you a perfectly good</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.406" end="00:23:46.306" style="s2">husband and you&#39;re attacking her because</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.306" end="00:23:46.306" style="s2">he doesn&#39;t have money?</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.006" end="00:23:51.506" style="s2">Your relationship with him is strained.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.106" end="00:23:54.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not strained.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.506" end="00:23:54.006" style="s2">Terrible.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.606" end="00:23:59.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And let me handle this.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.406" end="00:24:02.906" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.406" end="00:24:04.706" style="s2">I can&#39;t control you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.906" end="00:24:07.506" style="s2">Just answer one question.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.706" end="00:24:09.506" style="s2">Why did you attack Sabrina?</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.506" end="00:24:13.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because she had it coming.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.506" end="00:24:15.406" style="s2">Ask your other daughter what she did.</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.006" end="00:24:17.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did ask.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.406" end="00:24:19.406" style="s2">You were jealous because Brandon chose</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.106" end="00:24:20.806" style="s2">her, so you caused a scene trying to</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.406" end="00:24:24.106" style="s2">break it up.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.806" end="00:24:24.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This really is Mara &#39;s fault.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.106" end="00:24:28.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But even if Mara was wrong, she&#39;s still</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.908" end="00:24:29.908" style="s2">your daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.607" end="00:24:31.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what?</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.908" end="00:24:32.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have always been fair. If my</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.707" end="00:24:34.507" style="s2">daughter&#39;s in the wrong, I&#39;ll hold her</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.908" end="00:24:36.408" style="s2">accountable like anyone else.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.507" end="00:24:38.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. That&#39;s exactly what I needed to</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.408" end="00:24:38.707" style="s2">hear.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.207" end="00:24:43.607" style="s2">What is this? The gala footage shoving</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.107" end="00:24:45.707" style="s2">Leo to the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.607" end="00:24:48.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you get hotel security footage?</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.707" end="00:24:49.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I filed the complaint. Mr. Lawson&#39;s team</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.007" end="00:24:51.408" style="s2">sent the relevant clip and preserved the</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.408" end="00:24:52.707" style="s2">full footage for police. You said you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.408" end="00:24:54.307" style="s2">hold your daughter accountable. That</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.707" end="00:24:55.908" style="s2">goes for Sabrina, too.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.307" end="00:24:58.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You set me up.</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.908" end="00:24:59.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only asked you to apply your own rule</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.107" end="00:25:01.207" style="s2">and think twice before threatening my</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.507" end="00:25:01.607" style="s2">family. There&#39;s already a record of what</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.207" end="00:25:03.207" style="s2">happened.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.607" end="00:25:04.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You shameless little</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.207" end="00:25:06.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got to teach you a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.807" end="00:25:08.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t fight my wife&#39;s father, but I</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.607" end="00:25:09.807" style="s2">trained for years and I won&#39;t let you</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.007" end="00:25:10.707" style="s2">hit Mara or the children. So let&#39;s keep</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.807" end="00:25:12.107" style="s2">this a conversation.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.707" end="00:25:13.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have things to do. I&#39;m not wasting</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.107" end="00:25:15.207" style="s2">another minute on this.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.507" end="00:25:16.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Already leaving? We haven&#39;t seen the</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.207" end="00:25:18.362" style="s2">full footage yet.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.342" end="00:25:18.362" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.507" end="00:25:24.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really have footage from the gala?</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.707" end="00:25:26.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I filed a complaint as a husband and</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.007" end="00:25:27.707" style="s2">parent. Lawson&#39;s team sent me the clip.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.307" end="00:25:29.507" style="s2">That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.707" end="00:25:30.507" style="s2">Now tell me</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.507" end="00:25:32.908" style="s2">what happened between you and your</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.507" end="00:25:32.908" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.707" end="00:25:42.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, Lily, why don&#39;t you go take a bath?</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.107" end="00:25:42.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.607" end="00:25:47.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa brought Sabrina into our home</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.007" end="00:25:49.607" style="s2">when I was little. Sabrina was only a</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.908" end="00:25:51.307" style="s2">year younger than me. My mother never</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.607" end="00:25:52.908" style="s2">recovered from the betrayal. As soon as</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.307" end="00:25:53.607" style="s2">I could support myself, I left and lived</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.908" end="00:25:55.107" style="s2">on my own.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.607" end="00:25:56.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina&#39;s only a year younger, but that</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.107" end="00:25:58.007" style="s2">doesn&#39;t prove big of me. We need</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.607" end="00:25:59.408" style="s2">marriage records.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.007" end="00:26:00.908" style="s2">But if Vanessa took the education</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.408" end="00:26:03.007" style="s2">account your father set aside, there may</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.908" end="00:26:04.507" style="s2">be a paper trail.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.007" end="00:26:05.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After I left, I thought I was done with</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.507" end="00:26:07.507" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.607" end="00:26:08.908" style="s2">Then Vanessa found me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.507" end="00:26:10.607" style="s2">She used information about my missing</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.908" end="00:26:12.507" style="s2">children to force me to marry you in</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.607" end="00:26:15.707" style="s2">Sabrina&#39;s place.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.507" end="00:26:15.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa knows where your twins are?</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.007" end="00:26:21.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My twins were taken right after they</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.307" end="00:26:22.908" style="s2">were born. I&#39;ve searched for them for</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.107" end="00:26:24.908" style="s2">years and found nothing. Vanessa was the</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.908" end="00:26:26.307" style="s2">first to say she knew where they were.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.908" end="00:26:27.507" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.307" end="00:26:28.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you married me because you were</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.507" end="00:26:30.509" style="s2">forced,</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.707" end="00:26:33.609" style="s2">not because you knew I had</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.509" end="00:26:33.609" style="s2">I mean, not because you liked me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.509" end="00:26:39.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made yourself look terrifying. Who</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.109" end="00:26:39.309" style="s2">would fall for that overnight?</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.409" end="00:26:42.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now?</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.109" end="00:26:44.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now? You look good. You&#39;ve still got</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.909" end="00:26:48.609" style="s2">some work to do, though. I&#39;ve told you</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.609" end="00:26:48.609" style="s2">my story. Your turn. Full confession.</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.509" end="00:26:57.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t start wearing the scar because</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.909" end="00:26:57.509" style="s2">I wanted to.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.709" end="00:27:01.209" style="s2">Something happened years ago</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.709" end="00:27:03.809" style="s2">and it stayed with me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.209" end="00:27:03.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.209" end="00:27:07.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s hard to say.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.209" end="00:27:10.009" style="s2">When I was in school,</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.909" end="00:27:11.709" style="s2">someone became obsessed with me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.009" end="00:27:13.709" style="s2">One day, he and his friends cornered me</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.709" end="00:27:15.109" style="s2">after class. He tried to force himself</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.709" end="00:27:16.709" style="s2">on me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.109" end="00:27:18.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A woman?</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.709" end="00:27:19.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A man.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.309" end="00:27:21.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was assault.</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.809" end="00:27:23.109" style="s2">His gender doesn&#39;t change that.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.809" end="00:27:25.709" style="s2">I understand why you wanted to protect</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.109" end="00:27:27.309" style="s2">yourself afterwards.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.709" end="00:27:29.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not angry that I lied?</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.309" end="00:27:30.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You shouldn&#39;t have lied to me, but I</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.009" end="00:27:32.509" style="s2">understand why you felt you needed the</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.309" end="00:27:33.809" style="s2">scar.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.509" end="00:27:35.809" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.809" end="00:27:37.609" style="s2">At the hotel, I saw you with Apex&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.809" end="00:27:39.909" style="s2">executive assistant and a whole security</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.609" end="00:27:39.909" style="s2">team.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.109" end="00:27:44.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You must have seen someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.709" end="00:27:44.909" style="s2">If I were Apex&#39;s CEO, Victor</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.374" end="00:27:46.909" style="s2">[clears throat] Lawson would have</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.909" end="00:27:49.309" style="s2">recognized me instantly. Lawson Hotels</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.909" end="00:27:50.709" style="s2">works with Apex all the time.</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.309" end="00:27:52.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That makes sense,</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.709" end="00:27:55.109" style="s2">but he looked exactly like you. Let me</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.209" end="00:27:56.809" style="s2">look up Apex&#39;s CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.109" end="00:27:59.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to do that. What is there</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.809" end="00:28:00.509" style="s2">to see besides a handsome CEO?</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.509" end="00:28:02.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.509" end="00:28:04.509" style="s2">Now you&#39;ve got me curious.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.109" end="00:28:04.509" style="s2">Found it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.209" end="00:28:09.909" style="s2">There&#39;s no photo, just a name and a bio.</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.909" end="00:28:11.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.909" end="00:28:13.909" style="s2">I scrubbed every public photo before the</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.609" end="00:28:13.909" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.009" end="00:28:17.609" style="s2">If he hides from cameras, he probably</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.409" end="00:28:18.609" style="s2">likes his privacy. His life has nothing</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.609" end="00:28:19.509" style="s2">to do with ours.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.609" end="00:28:21.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fair.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.509" end="00:28:24.009" style="s2">I&#39;m letting the fake scar go this once,</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.809" end="00:28:26.709" style="s2">but no more lies, Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.009" end="00:28:26.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more lies.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.609" end="00:28:32.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad can talk his way out of anything.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.809" end="00:28:33.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if Mara finds her real kids and</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.309" end="00:28:33.910" style="s2">doesn&#39;t want us anymore?</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.709" end="00:28:36.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.910" end="00:28:38.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; not hers. Of course they&#39;d matter more.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.510" end="00:28:40.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want her to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.810" end="00:28:45.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s make her feel like we&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.210" end="00:28:45.410" style="s2">real family. Come here. I have a plan.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.310" end="00:28:50.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.310" end="00:28:52.410" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong, Lily?</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.410" end="00:28:53.804" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wants dad to stay with her tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.410" end="00:28:54.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then dad can stay with you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.804" end="00:28:56.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.210" end="00:28:59.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wants you there too.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.110" end="00:29:02.410" style="s2">Other kids get both parents at bedtime.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.110" end="00:29:04.810" style="s2">Are Leo and I still kids without a mom?</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.410" end="00:29:06.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your mom. We even have paperwork.</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.810" end="00:29:07.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you never sleep next to dad.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.610" end="00:29:09.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.610" end="00:29:11.510" style="s2">complicated.</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.410" end="00:29:14.010" style="s2">Okay, family sleepover. Dad and I will</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.510" end="00:29:14.010" style="s2">both stay.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.610" end="00:29:19.210" style="s2">Oh, sorry. Six pack. Didn&#39;t see that</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.910" end="00:29:19.710" style="s2">coming.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.210" end="00:29:20.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came [clears throat] in for a</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.710" end="00:29:22.910" style="s2">reason?</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.310" end="00:29:23.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily wants both of us there at bedtime.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.910" end="00:29:27.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both of us?</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.710" end="00:29:27.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Until they fall asleep, then you can go.</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.810" end="00:29:32.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do we get to turn into swans someday?</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.210" end="00:29:34.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re people, Lily. That&#39;s not how</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.510" end="00:29:34.910" style="s2">biology works.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.415" end="00:29:39.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.910" end="00:29:39.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s late, scientists. Time to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.110" end="00:29:46.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will this work? They&#39;ll get cold, move</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.510" end="00:29:49.010" style="s2">closer, and wake up feeling like a</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.310" end="00:29:52.910" style="s2">family, then maybe Mara won&#39;t leave.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.010" end="00:29:52.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s hope it gets really cold.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.410" end="00:29:59.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan?</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.610" end="00:30:10.610" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.010" end="00:30:14.210" style="s2">I woke up with someone holding me and my</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.610" end="00:30:14.210" style="s2">body reacted before my brain did.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.410" end="00:30:18.210" style="s2">You can be mad. Just don&#39;t ask me to let</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.310" end="00:30:20.910" style="s2">you kick me back.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.210" end="00:30:23.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not mad. I&#39;m confused. You launched</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.910" end="00:30:23.810" style="s2">me through drywall.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.510" end="00:30:29.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was born strong.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.410" end="00:30:31.110" style="s2">Very strong.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.710" end="00:30:33.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s funny. Lily says she was born</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.110" end="00:30:33.710" style="s2">strong too.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.310" end="00:30:37.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.110" end="00:30:40.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why am I</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.512" end="00:30:42.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; so much stronger than everyone else? Am</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.012" end="00:30:42.712" style="s2">I a freak?</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.212" end="00:30:47.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.412" end="00:30:49.912" style="s2">The women in our family are born this</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.912" end="00:30:51.912" style="s2">way. If you ever have a daughter, she</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.912" end="00:30:54.012" style="s2">may inherit it, too.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.912" end="00:30:57.312" style="s2">Lily is unusually strong.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.012" end="00:30:57.312" style="s2">And Leo and Lily are twins.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.712" end="00:31:12.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.112" end="00:31:12.512" style="s2">when you say you&#39;re strong, how strong?</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.112" end="00:31:22.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This strong.</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.612" end="00:31:22.212" style="s2">See? Super strong.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.712" end="00:31:31.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what you meant?</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.312" end="00:31:31.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yep.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.212" end="00:31:39.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could you lift something heavy?</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.312" end="00:31:39.112" style="s2">A boulder about this big?</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.512" end="00:31:45.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Just toys about my size.</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.212" end="00:31:48.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What were you thinking?</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.412" end="00:31:51.812" style="s2">There&#39;s no way these two are your</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.812" end="00:31:51.812" style="s2">missing twins.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.112" end="00:31:55.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sad?</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.612" end="00:31:58.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.712" end="00:31:59.112" style="s2">I still need to finish patching up your</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.112" end="00:32:00.612" style="s2">dad.</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.112" end="00:32:01.912" style="s2">You two play, and I&#39;ll make grilled</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.612" end="00:32:04.412" style="s2">cheese after.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.912" end="00:32:04.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.512" end="00:32:08.212" style="s2">You almost gave us away.</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.612" end="00:32:10.712" style="s2">Why can&#39;t we tell her I can lift a real</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.212" end="00:32:10.712" style="s2">boulder?</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.912" end="00:32:16.912" style="s2">Remember the last woman dad introduced</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.912" end="00:32:18.412" style="s2">us to?</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.912" end="00:32:20.512" style="s2">She saw your strength and called you a</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.412" end="00:32:23.112" style="s2">monster.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.512" end="00:32:26.212" style="s2">What if Mara gets scared, too?</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.112" end="00:32:26.212" style="s2">Then we keep it secret.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.812" end="00:32:35.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.312" end="00:32:35.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.312" end="00:32:40.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let me give you some good news.</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.713" end="00:32:44.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What news?</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.213" end="00:32:44.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.713" end="00:32:54.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said we needed more room.</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.513" end="00:32:56.713" style="s2">What do you think?</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.713" end="00:32:58.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.713" end="00:33:00.713" style="s2">And way out of our budget.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.513" end="00:33:03.513" style="s2">Your paycheck can&#39;t cover this place.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.713" end="00:33:03.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t pay rent.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.013" end="00:33:07.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.413" end="00:33:08.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boss owns it as an investment.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.513" end="00:33:10.413" style="s2">It was sitting empty, so he offered it</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.913" end="00:33:13.313" style="s2">with one condition.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.413" end="00:33:13.313" style="s2">We keep it in good shape.</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.213" end="00:33:18.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.913" end="00:33:18.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously.</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.357" end="00:33:25.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.513" end="00:33:25.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.513" end="00:33:34.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We want hugs too.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.013" end="00:33:34.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too.</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.423" end="00:33:39.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.318" end="00:33:45.338" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.313" end="00:33:51.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everybody gets a hug. All right, team,</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.613" end="00:33:54.013" style="s2">let&#39;s clean.</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.413" end="00:33:54.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about me?</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.513" end="00:33:59.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can carry the trash carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.913" end="00:34:14.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.913" end="00:34:15.813" style="s2">please don&#39;t hurt Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.413" end="00:34:19.513" style="s2">She humiliated Brandon and me at the</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.813" end="00:34:19.513" style="s2">Lawson event, but she&#39;s still my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.213" end="00:34:25.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t touch her.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.713" end="00:34:26.913" style="s2">Her husband boxed me in with my own</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.213" end="00:34:28.113" style="s2">words.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.913" end="00:34:30.513" style="s2">And the doorbell camera caught</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.113" end="00:34:30.513" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.913" end="00:34:34.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you fall for that?</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.913" end="00:34:39.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wanted an easy job with a big title.</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.113" end="00:34:42.013" style="s2">I got you design director at Summit</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.513" end="00:34:42.013" style="s2">Design.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.614" end="00:34:45.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Brandon.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.473" end="00:34:52.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.914" end="00:34:53.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m done. Time for work.</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.214" end="00:34:55.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looking like that?</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.314" end="00:34:56.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I drive. It&#39;s not exactly heavy lifting.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.914" end="00:34:58.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.914" end="00:35:01.614" style="s2">Stay home and heal.</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.714" end="00:35:01.614" style="s2">Kids, I&#39;m taking you out.</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.114" end="00:35:09.014" style="s2">Pick me up around the corner.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.214" end="00:35:14.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who did this to you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.414" end="00:35:14.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I fell.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.914" end="00:35:23.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run lawful background checks on Mars&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.614" end="00:35:25.014" style="s2">father, stepmother, and sister.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.214" end="00:35:27.014" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.014" end="00:35:28.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your husband is sharp. He got your dad</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.014" end="00:35:30.914" style="s2">to expose himself then use the doorbell</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.814" end="00:35:32.914" style="s2">video to stop the whole thing.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.914" end="00:35:35.514" style="s2">He&#39;s not that impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.914" end="00:35:38.214" style="s2">Strategic, handsome, and broke. Two out</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.514" end="00:35:38.214" style="s2">of three isn&#39;t bad.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.914" end="00:35:41.814" style="s2">Speaking of money, can you help me find</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.314" end="00:35:43.514" style="s2">a steady job?</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.814" end="00:35:45.014" style="s2">Summit Design is expanding after an</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.514" end="00:35:47.114" style="s2">acquisition.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.014" end="00:35:49.214" style="s2">A friend in HR said entry roles start</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.114" end="00:35:50.914" style="s2">around 58,000 a year.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.214" end="00:35:53.114" style="s2">I&#39;m doing it today.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.914" end="00:35:56.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad just bought Summit.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.114" end="00:35:56.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s ask him to help her.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.514" end="00:36:01.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need. I can make sure someone</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.414" end="00:36:03.314" style="s2">actually reads her resume.</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.114" end="00:36:03.314" style="s2">Done.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.014" end="00:36:10.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boss has a dinner tonight. I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.814" end="00:36:11.414" style="s2">late. Eat without me and get some rest.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.514" end="00:36:15.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.414" end="00:36:15.714" style="s2">Come on. Just one email.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.614" end="00:36:24.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.614" end="00:36:26.714" style="s2">I got it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.514" end="00:36:28.014" style="s2">I got the job at Summit.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.714" end="00:36:31.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too.</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.014" end="00:36:34.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Between my 58,000 and your dad&#39;s 60,000,</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.614" end="00:36:37.514" style="s2">we can afford Harbor View Preschool.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.114" end="00:36:37.514" style="s2">We&#39;re celebrating with ribs tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.114" end="00:36:42.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s this happy about 58,000. Imagine</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.114" end="00:36:44.916" style="s2">if she knew Dad was one of the richest</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.614" end="00:36:47.216" style="s2">men in the country. Dad said we can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.916" end="00:36:47.216" style="s2">tell.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.216" end="00:36:54.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re on kid duty.</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.716" end="00:36:54.016" style="s2">It&#39;s my first day at work.</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.616" end="00:36:59.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got a job?</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.916" end="00:37:02.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 58,000 a year. She says together you can</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.116" end="00:37:03.816" style="s2">send us to Harborview.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.316" end="00:37:05.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You took the job for them?</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.816" end="00:37:08.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Parents want their kids to have choices.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.916" end="00:37:11.116" style="s2">If they call me mom, I show up like one.</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.816" end="00:37:14.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But they&#39;re not biologically yours.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.116" end="00:37:14.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t make them less mine.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.516" end="00:37:17.516" style="s2">Why? You sound like you don&#39;t want me</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.116" end="00:37:19.216" style="s2">investing in them.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.516" end="00:37:20.316" style="s2">Are you planning to divorce me?</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.216" end="00:37:23.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.316" end="00:37:23.416" style="s2">I was going to tell you something.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.216" end="00:37:28.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me if Liam is a liar.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.416" end="00:37:32.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s Liam?</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.916" end="00:37:33.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her boyfriend. 5 years. What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.116" end="00:37:35.316" style="s2">He lied about everything.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.816" end="00:37:37.116" style="s2">Said he grew up broke. His parents</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.316" end="00:37:38.516" style="s2">worked the land. Scholarships paid for</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.116" end="00:37:40.216" style="s2">school and he was building a life from</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.516" end="00:37:42.016" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.216" end="00:37:42.916" style="s2">He He&#39;s a trust fund kid.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.016" end="00:37:45.015" style="s2">Rich?</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.916" end="00:37:45.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is being rich the crime?</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.015" end="00:37:47.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.216" end="00:37:50.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The money isn&#39;t the problem.</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.916" end="00:37:51.916" style="s2">I loved him, not his account.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.216" end="00:37:54.016" style="s2">The problem is that he made me fall for</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.916" end="00:37:56.616" style="s2">a person he invented.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.016" end="00:37:56.616" style="s2">I&#39;m ending it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.316" end="00:38:01.116" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to decide this second,</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.316" end="00:38:04.216" style="s2">but he owes you the full truth and space</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.116" end="00:38:04.216" style="s2">to choose what comes next.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.416" end="00:38:08.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe he was afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.016" end="00:38:09.916" style="s2">People hide things for stupid reasons</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.516" end="00:38:11.816" style="s2">without wanting to hurt anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.916" end="00:38:13.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fear explains it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.816" end="00:38:15.416" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t erase it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.516" end="00:38:17.116" style="s2">One lie that controls my choices is</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.416" end="00:38:18.416" style="s2">already serious.</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.116" end="00:38:20.316" style="s2">She&#39;s right. Ethan, what were you about</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.416" end="00:38:21.516" style="s2">to tell me?</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.316" end="00:38:22.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It slipped my mind. I&#39;ll tell you when</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.516" end="00:38:26.316" style="s2">it comes back.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.716" end="00:38:28.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I&#39;m late. Chloe will talk tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.316" end="00:38:31.816" style="s2">I&#39;m going to return every gift, look him</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.216" end="00:38:31.816" style="s2">in the eye and make him explain himself.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.716" end="00:38:38.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The car is ready, Mr. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.716" end="00:38:38.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m coming.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.116" end="00:38:43.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.516" end="00:38:47.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you leave me here, I tell Mara you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.516" end="00:38:47.116" style="s2">the owner, not a driver.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.416" end="00:38:50.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Threats aren&#39;t how</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.117" end="00:38:52.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; this family gets what it wants.</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.217" end="00:38:54.017" style="s2">We discuss it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.017" end="00:38:56.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I come too?</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.017" end="00:38:58.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a site visit at summit. Meetings,</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.217" end="00:38:59.517" style="s2">reports, no fun. I&#39;ll take you somewhere</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.617" end="00:39:02.417" style="s2">after.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.517" end="00:39:02.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still want to go.</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.617" end="00:39:05.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Both of you stay with Noah and do</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.517" end="00:39:08.217" style="s2">exactly what he says.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.917" end="00:39:08.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.517" end="00:39:12.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The owner&#39;s wife starts today. Be warm,</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.917" end="00:39:14.317" style="s2">be professional, and do not turn this</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.417" end="00:39:17.017" style="s2">into a circus. Understood?</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.317" end="00:39:17.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.517" end="00:39:21.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. Have a good one.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.317" end="00:39:25.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome, Mrs. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.417" end="00:39:30.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me? Mrs. Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.917" end="00:39:34.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.517" end="00:39:36.117" style="s2">Mara, Sabrina.</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.417" end="00:39:36.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are two of them. Which one is Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.117" end="00:39:38.117" style="s2">Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.717" end="00:39:39.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The designer bag says it&#39;s her. The</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.117" end="00:39:41.717" style="s2">other one looks like a regular new hire.</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.917" end="00:39:42.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The woman in designer clothes, of</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.717" end="00:39:44.317" style="s2">course.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.717" end="00:39:45.917" style="s2">This way.</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.317" end="00:39:47.417" style="s2">Welcome, Mrs. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.917" end="00:39:48.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina&#39;s Mrs. Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.417" end="00:39:50.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brandon must have arranged VIP</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.917" end="00:39:52.717" style="s2">treatment. Why correct them? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.617" end="00:39:54.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right this way, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.717" end="00:39:58.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.617" end="00:39:58.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when is Sabrina married to a Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.517" end="00:40:02.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your desk is here.</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.717" end="00:40:04.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.917" end="00:40:06.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A handsome husband is useless without</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.417" end="00:40:07.117" style="s2">money or connections. You start at a</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.317" end="00:40:08.517" style="s2">cubicle, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.117" end="00:40:11.317" style="s2">Brandon makes one call, and I become</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.517" end="00:40:11.317" style="s2">design director.</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.392" end="00:40:14.817" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.117" end="00:40:17.117" style="s2">What? [music] I wondered what smelled</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.817" end="00:40:18.317" style="s2">rotten. It was the entitlement.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.117" end="00:40:19.917" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.317" end="00:40:23.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apex&#39;s CEO is here with senior</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.917" end="00:40:23.917" style="s2">leadership. Everyone outside now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.617" end="00:40:26.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would the CEO visit today?</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.148" end="00:40:28.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.617" end="00:40:30.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You started this morning and he appears</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.117" end="00:40:32.517" style="s2">by lunch. Obviously he came to see his</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.117" end="00:40:32.517" style="s2">wife.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.617" end="00:40:33.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The CEO?</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.353" end="00:40:36.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.717" end="00:40:39.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; E. Cole, the Apex CEO, your husband. No</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.817" end="00:40:41.917" style="s2">one has a clear public photo of him.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.117" end="00:40:45.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They think I&#39;m married to Apex&#39;s CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.917" end="00:40:45.117" style="s2">I need the restroom. Excuse me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.817" end="00:40:48.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s here. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.817" end="00:40:50.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome,</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.118" end="00:40:50.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.918" end="00:40:54.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan?</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.818" end="00:40:57.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.418" end="00:41:02.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is she doing here? Mr. Cole, are</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.218" end="00:41:03.418" style="s2">you all right?</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.818" end="00:41:05.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.418" end="00:41:07.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s not the CEO. He&#39;s a driver who</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.418" end="00:41:09.018" style="s2">makes 60,000 a year.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.118" end="00:41:11.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But he&#39;s with the executive team.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.018" end="00:41:12.318" style="s2">And Mr. Bennett called him Mr. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.018" end="00:41:14.518" style="s2">She&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.318" end="00:41:15.618" style="s2">I drive for the CEO. He canceled at the</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.518" end="00:41:16.418" style="s2">last minute.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.618" end="00:41:19.318" style="s2">Mr. Co</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.418" end="00:41:21.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, the driver.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.318" end="00:41:24.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Ethan is the driver. The CEO had</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.818" end="00:41:25.218" style="s2">an emergency, so I&#39;m leading the visit.</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.118" end="00:41:26.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.218" end="00:41:30.018" style="s2">The conference room is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.818" end="00:41:30.018" style="s2">Executives, this way.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.618" end="00:41:41.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing? Your bosses haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.318" end="00:41:41.818" style="s2">sat down.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.418" end="00:41:58.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is everyone ready?</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.518" end="00:42:01.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, sit.</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.218" end="00:42:01.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, everyone, sit.</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.318" end="00:42:05.018" style="s2">Then let&#39;s begin.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.918" end="00:42:11.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you arrive with Apex executives?</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.618" end="00:42:12.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boss came for the visit, so I drove</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.218" end="00:42:14.218" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.318" end="00:42:15.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your boss is Apex CEO?</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.218" end="00:42:17.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.818" end="00:42:19.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s he like? He avoids cameras. Is he</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.718" end="00:42:21.418" style="s2">secretly hideous?</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.318" end="00:42:23.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Terribly handsome, young, brilliant,</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.418" end="00:42:24.918" style="s2">generous, exactly like those impossible</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.318" end="00:42:26.018" style="s2">romance billionaires, especially the</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.918" end="00:42:27.718" style="s2">real estate portfolio.</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.018" end="00:42:29.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two can keep fantasizing. I own a</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.718" end="00:42:30.518" style="s2">mansion, too. Everyone is invited</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.818" end="00:42:33.118" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.518" end="00:42:34.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A mansion in Newport Coast?</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.118" end="00:42:36.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With her husband, it has to be eight</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.618" end="00:42:40.918" style="s2">figures.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.618" end="00:42:42.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cars, ocean views must be nice.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.918" end="00:42:43.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I married well.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.318" end="00:42:45.818" style="s2">Mara, you could still trade in the</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.718" end="00:42:47.018" style="s2">driver. I can introduce you to someone</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.818" end="00:42:49.618" style="s2">with money.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.018" end="00:42:51.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t call my dad worthless.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.618" end="00:42:53.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, but a man with no home of his own</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.720" end="00:42:54.120" style="s2">isn&#39;t exactly impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.120" end="00:42:56.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad has a mansion.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.120" end="00:42:58.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.320" end="00:43:00.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then invite us there first. Everyone can</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.320" end="00:43:01.020" style="s2">see yours tonight [music] and mine this</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.020" end="00:43:05.220" style="s2">weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.020" end="00:43:05.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, you&#39;re secretly rich? Can we come?</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.520" end="00:43:08.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.420" end="00:43:10.020" style="s2">Unless you think your coworkers will</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.720" end="00:43:11.920" style="s2">dirty the place.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.020" end="00:43:12.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She doesn&#39;t think that. Stop twisting</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.920" end="00:43:13.420" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.420" end="00:43:16.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why say no?</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.420" end="00:43:16.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She didn&#39;t say no.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.120" end="00:43:20.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m doomed. Where am I supposed to find</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.020" end="00:43:22.720" style="s2">a mansion?</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.020" end="00:43:22.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad has one.</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.120" end="00:43:28.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember? It belongs to my boss. I took</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.420" end="00:43:29.820" style="s2">you there while Mara was out.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.220" end="00:43:32.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would guests bother him?</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.820" end="00:43:34.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one is staying there right now.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.520" end="00:43:35.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if we only stop outside, then I</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.420" end="00:43:37.620" style="s2">pretend I forgot the key and take</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.820" end="00:43:38.420" style="s2">everyone home?</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.620" end="00:43:40.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brilliant.</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.420" end="00:43:42.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask your boss first.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.120" end="00:43:42.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.520" end="00:43:47.720" style="s2">He said yes.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.920" end="00:43:50.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saved me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.720" end="00:43:52.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina insulted Mara and Dad. Tonight</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.120" end="00:43:55.120" style="s2">she learns not to judge people by money.</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.820" end="00:43:55.120" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.420" end="00:43:59.020" style="s2">Grandpa, Grandma.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.020" end="00:44:00.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t seen you in months. I miss you</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.020" end="00:44:02.420" style="s2">both.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.620" end="00:44:05.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s your father, Lily?</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.420" end="00:44:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He went out with Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.120" end="00:44:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom?</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.820" end="00:44:11.520" style="s2">He got married and never told us? I</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.120" end="00:44:13.620" style="s2">almost introduced him to the Whitmore</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.520" end="00:44:15.120" style="s2">family. Leo, tell your father to bring</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.620" end="00:44:17.420" style="s2">his wife to us.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.120" end="00:44:18.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll fly out. I want Mara to feel</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.420" end="00:44:20.720" style="s2">welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.620" end="00:44:22.520" style="s2">I &#39;ll bring the family emerald bracelet</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.720" end="00:44:24.520" style="s2">and the Laguna condo papers in case</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.520" end="00:44:25.820" style="s2">she&#39;d like a place of her own.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.520" end="00:44:27.420" style="s2">Is that too much?</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.820" end="00:44:28.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We haven&#39;t met her. Maybe start with</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.420" end="00:44:31.520" style="s2">hello.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.520" end="00:44:33.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know Ethan kept this marriage from us.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.520" end="00:44:35.420" style="s2">What else has he kept from her? Most of</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.420" end="00:44:37.320" style="s2">my cash is tied up in that clean energy</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.420" end="00:44:38.420" style="s2">investment. I can at least show her what</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.320" end="00:44:40.420" style="s2">I already own.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.420" end="00:44:41.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She needs us to listen, not hand her an</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.420" end="00:44:42.720" style="s2">inventory.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.320" end="00:44:44.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if she thinks we&#39;re trying to buy</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.720" end="00:44:46.220" style="s2">her affection?</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.520" end="00:44:46.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we put the papers away and get to</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.220" end="00:44:47.920" style="s2">know her.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.820" end="00:44:49.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.920" end="00:44:53.020" style="s2">We listen first.</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.820" end="00:44:55.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is it. Let me get the door.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.020" end="00:44:56.721" style="s2">I forgot the key. Did you bring yours?</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.221" end="00:44:58.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apparently not.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.721" end="00:44:59.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. We&#39;ll have to do this another</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.521" end="00:45:01.521" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.921" end="00:45:03.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forgot the key?</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.521" end="00:45:05.021" style="s2">This isn&#39;t your house.</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.021" end="00:45:06.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina, let it go. We can come another</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.021" end="00:45:09.321" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.021" end="00:45:09.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely, next time.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.021" end="00:45:13.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you&#39;re home.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.921" end="00:45:17.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This living room is bigger than my</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.621" end="00:45:18.221" style="s2">apartment.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.621" end="00:45:20.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That [clears throat] looks like an</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.221" end="00:45:22.021" style="s2">authenticated Bisqueua.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.021" end="00:45:24.121" style="s2">It could be worth millions.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.021" end="00:45:26.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina looked rich. Mara, you&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.121" end="00:45:27.721" style="s2">real surprise.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.221" end="00:45:30.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.721" end="00:45:32.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad brought us before. We have a key.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.621" end="00:45:33.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch anything. We can never</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.021" end="00:45:35.421" style="s2">replace it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.321" end="00:45:38.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.421" end="00:45:40.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her husband is a $60,000 driver. This</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.321" end="00:45:42.221" style="s2">place has to be rented for the night.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.821" end="00:45:43.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show me the rental listing.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.221" end="00:45:45.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then open the wine.</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.621" end="00:45:47.121" style="s2">If it&#39;s really yours, you won&#39;t mind.</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.321" end="00:45:49.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those are rare Burgundies. Some bottles</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.121" end="00:45:51.721" style="s2">run $10,000.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.621" end="00:45:52.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $10,000 a bottle?</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.721" end="00:45:54.821" style="s2">Can we try one?</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.621" end="00:45:57.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe, but I don&#39;t see a corkscrew. Leo,</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.821" end="00:45:57.421" style="s2">could you look?</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.521" end="00:46:00.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.321" end="00:46:04.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s incredibly generous. Thank</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.821" end="00:46:06.721" style="s2">[music] you, Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.121" end="00:46:06.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m finished.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.121" end="00:46:11.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. Those aren&#39;t the rare</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.821" end="00:46:12.621" style="s2">bottles.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.121" end="00:46:15.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They are not?</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.621" end="00:46:17.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo had the staff lock the valuable wine</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.421" end="00:46:20.321" style="s2">in the cellar. These came from the</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.421" end="00:46:20.321" style="s2">grocery store.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.472" end="00:46:27.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.221" end="00:46:27.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two are lifesavers.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.821" end="00:46:32.721" style="s2">Everyone, enjoy. It&#39;s table wine, not a</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.521" end="00:46:35.021" style="s2">museum piece.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.721" end="00:46:35.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.721" end="00:46:39.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few bottles and suddenly everyone is</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.321" end="00:46:41.021" style="s2">impressed. Small town [music] tastes.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.821" end="00:46:42.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then bring something better this</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.021" end="00:46:44.521" style="s2">weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.421" end="00:46:44.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.021" end="00:46:49.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom? [music] You and dad are already</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.721" end="00:46:49.921" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.621" end="00:46:54.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My parents are back.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.721" end="00:46:56.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.021" end="00:46:56.922" style="s2">I didn&#39;t change or bring a gift.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.321" end="00:46:59.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take the kids to</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.922" end="00:47:01.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; meet them. Stay with your co-workers.</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.323" end="00:47:01.922" style="s2">You can meet tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.523" end="00:47:08.323" style="s2">You can say he&#39;d pick us up.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.523" end="00:47:11.723" style="s2">Why did you come here?</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.323" end="00:47:13.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The papers for this house are here too.</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.723" end="00:47:15.223" style="s2">If Mara wants a place of her own, we can</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.523" end="00:47:18.723" style="s2">offer it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.223" end="00:47:18.723" style="s2">Let&#39;s hear what she wants first.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.323" end="00:47:29.323" style="s2">Who are you and why are you in my house?</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.723" end="00:47:34.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.622" end="00:47:38.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I left the car key inside. We have to go</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.523" end="00:47:38.922" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.023" end="00:47:45.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your house?</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.823" end="00:47:53.023" style="s2">Yes. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.622" end="00:47:55.122" style="s2">My name is on the deed.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.023" end="00:47:56.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, dad taught us to be honest. You</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.122" end="00:47:58.823" style="s2">passed off someone else&#39;s home as yours.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.922" end="00:48:00.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it isn&#39;t Mara&#39;s and the wine isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.823" end="00:48:01.922" style="s2">hers either?</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.023" end="00:48:03.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bottles out here are ordinary. The</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.922" end="00:48:05.323" style="s2">rare wine is locked downstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.622" end="00:48:07.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good, because none of us agreed to drink</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.323" end="00:48:10.323" style="s2">five-figure wine. Mara, you put everyone</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.723" end="00:48:12.323" style="s2">in a terrible position.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.323" end="00:48:15.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now the real owner is here. Let&#39;s see</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.323" end="00:48:15.323" style="s2">how you escape this.</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.622" end="00:48:19.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.823" end="00:48:23.323" style="s2">I said something untrue because I was</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.723" end="00:48:27.122" style="s2">cornered, but that was still my choice.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.323" end="00:48:29.223" style="s2">Please total any loss. I&#39;ll repay it.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.122" end="00:48:30.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She takes responsibility.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.223" end="00:48:32.622" style="s2">I like her.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.523" end="00:48:35.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In that case</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.622" end="00:48:35.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, Grandma.</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.323" end="00:48:41.422" style="s2">Grandma?</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.523" end="00:48:44.622" style="s2">Grandpa?</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.422" end="00:48:44.622" style="s2">Ethan, they&#39;re your parents?</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.323" end="00:48:48.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.523" end="00:48:50.422" style="s2">They don&#39;t know I&#39;m hiding my identity.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.523" end="00:48:53.622" style="s2">This is a disaster.</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.422" end="00:48:53.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my daughter-in-law?</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.023" end="00:48:57.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.922" end="00:48:59.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She called me mom.</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.922" end="00:49:02.324" style="s2">Richard, I finally have a daughter</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.724" end="00:49:02.324" style="s2">-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.424" end="00:49:06.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was convinced I&#39;d never marry. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.224" end="00:49:06.724" style="s2">overwhelmed.</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.024" end="00:49:10.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand. Mom, sit down. I&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.124" end="00:49:12.124" style="s2">you water.</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.024" end="00:49:14.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Water can wait. Richard, bring me my</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.124" end="00:49:14.824" style="s2">mother&#39;s bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.324" end="00:49:20.424" style="s2">This emerald bracelet was Ethan&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.624" end="00:49:22.024" style="s2">grandmother&#39;s. I&#39;d like you to have it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.424" end="00:49:23.624" style="s2">The Laguna condo and this house are in</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.024" end="00:49:24.824" style="s2">my name, too.</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.624" end="00:49:26.624" style="s2">If having a place of your own would</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.824" end="00:49:29.824" style="s2">help, [music] we can talk.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.624" end="00:49:29.824" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to decide tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.024" end="00:49:37.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did your mother give me a bracelet</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.224" end="00:49:39.124" style="s2">and offer me property?</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.024" end="00:49:41.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bracelet is hers. The properties are</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.124" end="00:49:43.024" style="s2">offers, not transfers. Mom wanted you to</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.524" end="00:49:44.124" style="s2">feel welcome. I should have asked her to</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.024" end="00:49:46.224" style="s2">slow down.</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.124" end="00:49:47.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She even showed me the deeds.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.224" end="00:49:49.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.124" end="00:49:51.524" style="s2">She overstepped. I&#39;ll talk to her.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.824" end="00:49:54.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care if you&#39;re poor.</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.524" end="00:49:54.724" style="s2">We can build a life ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.424" end="00:49:58.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we tell my parents?</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.824" end="00:50:00.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can accept the bracelet tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.624" end="00:50:01.824" style="s2">[music] I won&#39;t accept property, at</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.524" end="00:50:04.124" style="s2">least not until I understand what it</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.824" end="00:50:04.124" style="s2">means.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.524" end="00:50:10.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.524" end="00:50:11.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She took the bracelet and she still</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.324" end="00:50:13.224" style="s2">wants to talk to us.</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.924" end="00:50:15.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try on the bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.224" end="00:50:15.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.624" end="00:50:22.624" style="s2">It belongs on you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.824" end="00:50:26.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It looks fake.</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.324" end="00:50:27.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It isn&#39;t. I saw that piece at a charity</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.324" end="00:50:28.324" style="s2">auction preview.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.324" end="00:50:31.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where do you work, Mara?</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.324" end="00:50:31.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a junior designer at Summit.</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.424" end="00:50:35.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good field.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.624" end="00:50:37.324" style="s2">Plenty of room to grow.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.624" end="00:50:38.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s probationary.</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.324" end="00:50:40.024" style="s2">With me as director, she won&#39;t make it</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.624" end="00:50:41.824" style="s2">past 90 days.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.024" end="00:50:44.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s retaliation.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.824" end="00:50:46.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, are you going to protect her?</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.024" end="00:50:48.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call your boss.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.324" end="00:50:49.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good idea.</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.124" end="00:50:51.124" style="s2">Mr. Cole, I&#39;d like to report that</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.724" end="00:50:52.924" style="s2">Summit&#39;s design director threatened a</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.124" end="00:50:54.224" style="s2">probationary employee in public.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.924" end="00:50:57.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll preserve the witness statements</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.224" end="00:50:57.824" style="s2">and send it to HR and compliance now.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.924" end="00:51:05.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean I&#39;m suspended pending</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.425" end="00:51:05.925" style="s2">review?</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.025" end="00:51:10.725" style="s2">How can they suspend me?</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.825" end="00:51:13.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You threatened an employee.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.725" end="00:51:13.725" style="s2">HR has witnesses.</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.325" end="00:51:17.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s one job.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.925" end="00:51:21.225" style="s2">Brandon can buy me another title. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.925" end="00:51:21.225" style="s2">not the defense you think it is.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.325" end="00:51:24.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A vintage Maserati Spider.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.425" end="00:51:26.025" style="s2">Expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.725" end="00:51:28.325" style="s2">And Shaw Development can&#39;t afford it</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.025" end="00:51:28.325" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.625" end="00:51:32.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you saying?</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.625" end="00:51:34.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Their lenders froze new credit after an</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.125" end="00:51:34.925" style="s2">audit. Colin.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.225" end="00:51:41.525" style="s2">Brandon, are you in trouble?</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.925" end="00:51:44.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have a liquidity problem. Can you</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.525" end="00:51:44.125" style="s2">lend me anything?</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.525" end="00:51:52.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t over.</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.025" end="00:52:00.025" style="s2">How did you know about Shaw&#39;s credit?</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.925" end="00:52:01.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boss mentioned the audit. He cut</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.025" end="00:52:03.825" style="s2">business with Brandon after what</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.225" end="00:52:03.825" style="s2">happened to you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.925" end="00:52:11.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.425" end="00:52:11.225" style="s2">Actions finally have consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.925" end="00:52:15.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have better news coming.</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.425" end="00:52:20.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.425" end="00:52:20.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Soon.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.125" end="00:52:26.525" style="s2">Did Mara do this to you again?</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.025" end="00:52:29.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She reported me because she was jealous</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.525" end="00:52:29.225" style="s2">of my job.</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.425" end="00:52:34.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I confront her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.025" end="00:52:48.325" style="s2">Ethan?</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.325" end="00:52:49.625" style="s2">This is a misunderstanding. Your family.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.325" end="00:52:52.025" style="s2">Sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.625" end="00:52:53.725" style="s2">This is a recorded voluntary interview.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.025" end="00:52:55.625" style="s2">Your attorney is present. You may leave,</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.725" end="00:52:57.425" style="s2">but the preservation notice remains. You</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.625" end="00:52:59.725" style="s2">have repeatedly harassed my wife. That</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.425" end="00:53:01.925" style="s2">stops today.</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.725" end="00:53:03.925" style="s2">First, apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.925" end="00:53:05.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.925" end="00:53:06.327" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.425" end="00:53:09.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I &#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.327" end="00:53:09.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now the missing twins.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.027" end="00:53:14.427" style="s2">Vanessa,</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.127" end="00:53:16.827" style="s2">did you transfer Mara&#39;s newborns?</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.427" end="00:53:16.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.227" end="00:53:22.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are they?</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.827" end="00:53:22.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know where they are now.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.327" end="00:53:28.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell us what you do know.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.627" end="00:53:30.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A woman paid me $100,000 to hand over</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.027" end="00:53:31.527" style="s2">the babies. I followed her afterwards</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.127" end="00:53:32.527" style="s2">and found her address.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.527" end="00:53:37.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.527" end="00:53:37.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 701 1180 Harbor Street, Long Beach.</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.727" end="00:53:40.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Name?</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.827" end="00:53:44.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Linda Mercel.</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.227" end="00:53:46.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Any further contact with Mara goes</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.927" end="00:53:47.527" style="s2">through counsel.</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.127" end="00:53:49.127" style="s2">If you harass her again, we&#39;ll seek a</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.527" end="00:53:51.927" style="s2">restraining order and every lawful</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.127" end="00:53:51.927" style="s2">remedy available.</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.027" end="00:53:59.327" style="s2">Stay home.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.627" end="00:53:59.327" style="s2">I have good news.</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.527" end="00:54:09.927" style="s2">Mara,</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.727" end="00:54:09.927" style="s2">I found a lead to your twins.</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.527" end="00:54:18.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all these years, what if they</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.727" end="00:54:19.927" style="s2">don&#39;t want me?</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.327" end="00:54:20.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t abandon them. They were</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.927" end="00:54:23.627" style="s2">taken.</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.927" end="00:54:23.627" style="s2">The truth matters.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.427" end="00:54:28.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you looking for? Linda Mercer.</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.727" end="00:54:30.827" style="s2">Does she live here?</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.727" end="00:54:31.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She moved 5 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.827" end="00:54:35.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know where?</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.927" end="00:54:38.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. She sold the unit and disappeared.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.427" end="00:54:38.827" style="s2">Please call if you remember anything.</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.627" end="00:54:47.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Cole, the twins&#39; birth mother found</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.927" end="00:54:49.527" style="s2">the old address.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.827" end="00:54:52.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So she finally traced it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.527" end="00:54:53.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should security intervene?</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.127" end="00:54:54.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.127" end="00:54:56.727" style="s2">I took the babies because I decided she</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.727" end="00:54:59.527" style="s2">wasn&#39;t good enough for Ethan. 5 years</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.727" end="00:55:01.727" style="s2">later, he still never chose anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.527" end="00:55:04.227" style="s2">Arrange a meeting and bring Ethan here</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.727" end="00:55:04.227" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.727" end="00:55:10.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll We&#39;ll keep looking.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.628" end="00:55:18.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find the child&#39;s biological mother.</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.828" end="00:55:18.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You found Leo and Lily&#39;s birth mother?</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.028" end="00:55:21.528" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.228" end="00:55:26.428" style="s2">Mara, I have to handle something.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.928" end="00:55:27.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll get home myself.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.428" end="00:55:30.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll call a car.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.428" end="00:55:32.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.228" end="00:55:36.128" style="s2">Their real mother is back.</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.228" end="00:55:36.128" style="s2">Maybe my borrowed family just expired.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.528" end="00:55:45.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look sad.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.728" end="00:55:46.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have good news.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.428" end="00:55:49.228" style="s2">Your birth mother was found.</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.628" end="00:55:51.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you&#39;re our mom.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.228" end="00:55:52.928" style="s2">You&#39;re scared we&#39;ll leave. We won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.528" end="00:55:55.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if Dad leaves?</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.928" end="00:55:57.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he can explain himself. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.128" end="00:55:57.928" style="s2">lose us with him.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.328" end="00:56:04.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will find you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.528" end="00:56:09.028" style="s2">You remembered something? I&#39;m coming</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.728" end="00:56:09.028" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.328" end="00:56:16.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Linda Mercer?</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.128" end="00:56:18.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.728" end="00:56:20.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vanessa sold me access to your newborn</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.428" end="00:56:20.928" style="s2">twins.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.028" end="00:56:24.828" style="s2">I delivered them to the woman who paid</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.428" end="00:56:27.828" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.828" end="00:56:27.828" style="s2">Where are my children?</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.828" end="00:56:36.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meet their father there.</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.528" end="00:56:36.628" style="s2">He has the rest of the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.328" end="00:56:42.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were drugged that night.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.228" end="00:56:44.128" style="s2">Mara was also unable to consent.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.228" end="00:56:46.128" style="s2">When she gave birth, I paid Vanessa to</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.128" end="00:56:47.028" style="s2">take the twins because I judged Mara by</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.128" end="00:56:48.228" style="s2">her class.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.028" end="00:56:51.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You separated a mother from her</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.228" end="00:56:53.628" style="s2">children. Why tell me now?</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.528" end="00:56:54.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meet her. She deserves the truth and the</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.628" end="00:56:55.928" style="s2">children deserve a choice.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.928" end="00:56:59.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.928" end="00:56:59.328" style="s2">And then we discuss accountability.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.689" end="00:57:07.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.729" end="00:57:27.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara?</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.329" end="00:57:30.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you here to meet Leo and Lily&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.729" end="00:57:32.229" style="s2">birth mother?</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.129" end="00:57:35.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only to learn the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.229" end="00:57:37.129" style="s2">Nothing changes what I feel about you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.529" end="00:57:38.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t need to [music] promise.</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.129" end="00:57:41.029" style="s2">I trust you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.929" end="00:57:43.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.029" end="00:57:45.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To meet my twin&#39;s father.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.829" end="00:57:47.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man from that night?</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.529" end="00:57:47.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.529" end="00:58:06.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara?</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.929" end="00:58:08.129" style="s2">I thought Ethan brought you somewhere</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.029" end="00:58:09.429" style="s2">expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.129" end="00:58:10.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It isn&#39;t Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.429" end="00:58:11.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then who?</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.535" end="00:58:13.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.129" end="00:58:15.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My twin&#39;s father.</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.629" end="00:58:19.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happens if he wants a family?</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.729" end="00:58:19.429" style="s2">You already have Ethan and the kids.</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.029" end="00:58:25.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.129" end="00:58:25.629" style="s2">I won&#39;t abandon any of the children.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.829" end="00:58:31.550" style="s2">First I need facts. Then we decide</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.029" end="00:58:31.550" style="s2">what&#39;s safe and right for them. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.329" end="00:58:41.029" style="s2">Imagine if Ethan is the father</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.329" end="00:58:44.729" style="s2">and Leo and Lily are your twins.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.029" end="00:58:44.729" style="s2">One impossible answer fixes everything.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.429" end="00:58:51.529" style="s2">Even a soap opera would reject that.</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.229" end="00:58:51.529" style="s2">I&#39;m staying until you feel safe.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.765" end="00:58:55.785" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.529" end="00:59:04.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara?</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.129" end="00:59:16.231" style="s2">I I where the children are.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.931" end="00:59:24.731" style="s2">You get access only if you marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.731" end="00:59:24.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is coercion, not a proposal.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.031" end="00:59:40.331" style="s2">You finally know who I am.</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.531" end="00:59:45.531" style="s2">I am Leo and Lily&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.531" end="00:59:51.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You claim you are their mother.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.531" end="00:59:51.931" style="s2">Prove it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.931" end="01:00:00.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Dayton Hotel match.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.931" end="01:00:00.331" style="s2">You left this engraved watch behind.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.731" end="01:00:04.431" style="s2">I carried them,</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.731" end="01:00:07.431" style="s2">suffered for them,</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.431" end="01:00:07.431" style="s2">and only want visits.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.531" end="01:00:15.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No contact until an accredited DNA test</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.331" end="01:00:16.931" style="s2">and a child safety review.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.231" end="01:00:20.431" style="s2">Do not approach them</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.931" end="01:00:20.431" style="s2">or expose private information.</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.567" end="01:00:40.587" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.931" end="01:00:45.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, don&#39;t rush into another marriage</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.831" end="01:00:46.131" style="s2">just because you&#39;re desperate to find</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.031" end="01:00:48.831" style="s2">your child.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.131" end="01:00:49.731" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.831" end="01:00:51.331" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.731" end="01:00:53.731" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that Sabrina sitting across from</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.331" end="01:00:53.731" style="s2">Ethan?</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.331" end="01:00:58.831" style="s2">So Sabrina claims she is their mother?</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.531" end="01:01:01.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only want to visit them.</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.831" end="01:01:03.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not without verified DNA, counsel, and a</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.131" end="01:01:06.031" style="s2">safety plan. Leave my home now.</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.831" end="01:01:07.431" style="s2">Kids, pack for school. No one is hitting</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.031" end="01:01:09.131" style="s2">anyone. Ethan and I need an honest</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.431" end="01:01:10.331" style="s2">conversation.</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.131" end="01:01:13.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should have told you before she came</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.331" end="01:01:13.131" style="s2">here. I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.731" end="01:01:18.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop with the puppy eyes. If Sabrina is</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.332" end="01:01:19.032" style="s2">their mother, when do you plan to</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.232" end="01:01:20.932" style="s2">divorce me?</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.032" end="01:01:22.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t. You are my wife and no one</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.932" end="01:01:25.232" style="s2">unverified claim can change that. Kids,</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.932" end="01:01:25.232" style="s2">tell her.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.732" end="01:01:31.677" style="s2">Who is your mom?</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.632" end="01:01:31.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.732" end="01:01:35.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We are a family because we keep choosing</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.432" end="01:01:35.832" style="s2">one another.</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.532" end="01:01:41.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $8,000? Where did you get this?</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.632" end="01:01:42.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boss&#39;s company had a sample sale. It</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.432" end="01:01:44.232" style="s2">can&#39;t be resold, so I got it almost</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.932" end="01:01:45.532" style="s2">free.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.232" end="01:01:48.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It looks real.</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.532" end="01:01:48.432" style="s2">Thank you, my husband.</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.307" end="01:01:51.327" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.132" end="01:01:55.532" style="s2">Ethan believes I might be the twins&#39;</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.532" end="01:01:57.632" style="s2">mother. Our future depends on you</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.532" end="01:01:59.232" style="s2">getting into that family. [music] I took</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.632" end="01:02:02.232" style="s2">Brandon from Mara.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.232" end="01:02:02.232" style="s2">I can take Ethan too.</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.332" end="01:02:06.932" style="s2">We drugged Mara and she ended up with</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.932" end="01:02:09.032" style="s2">one of the richest men in America. She</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.932" end="01:02:11.332" style="s2">never even recognized him. I&#39;ll take the</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.032" end="01:02:13.932" style="s2">life she wasted. Listen to your teacher</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.332" end="01:02:13.932" style="s2">and have fun.</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.132" end="01:02:17.932" style="s2">Is that designer? We should connect.</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.232" end="01:02:19.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was an internal sample. I didn&#39;t pay</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.932" end="01:02:21.032" style="s2">retail.</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.032" end="01:02:22.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it&#39;s a knockoff. People will fake</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.032" end="01:02:25.032" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.732" end="01:02:26.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch my mom&#39;s things.</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.032" end="01:02:28.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t need approval from someone who</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.432" end="01:02:30.232" style="s2">changes manners based on a price tag.</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.932" end="01:02:32.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you threatening me?</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.232" end="01:02:34.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Kids, if anyone bullies you, step</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.932" end="01:02:38.932" style="s2">away, tell a teacher, and defend only</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.832" end="01:02:38.932" style="s2">enough to get safe. Never start a fight.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.432" end="01:02:47.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.732" end="01:02:47.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m their biological mother.</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.832" end="01:02:50.332" style="s2">Then Mara stole somebody&#39;s husband and</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.632" end="01:02:53.132" style="s2">kids.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.332" end="01:02:54.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She didn&#39;t steal us. She&#39;s our mom.</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.132" end="01:02:57.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She must be manipulative if the kids</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.532" end="01:02:57.132" style="s2">defend her.</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.532" end="01:03:01.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save the apology.</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.232" end="01:03:02.932" style="s2">You announced an unverified claim in</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.632" end="01:03:04.832" style="s2">front of parents and children. I know</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.932" end="01:03:08.332" style="s2">exactly what you were doing.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.832" end="01:03:08.332" style="s2">Knowing doesn&#39;t mean you can stop me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.332" end="01:03:13.132" style="s2">I took Brandon from you. Now I&#39;ll take</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.232" end="01:03:14.932" style="s2">Ethan. I&#39;m the twins&#39; real mother.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.132" end="01:03:16.632" style="s2">You&#39;re the intruder.</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.932" end="01:03:18.433" style="s2">You&#39;re weaponizing my mother&#39;s death and</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.632" end="01:03:20.733" style="s2">children you haven&#39;t proved are yours?</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.433" end="01:03:21.633" style="s2">That is shameless. Leave Ethan before I</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.733" end="01:03:23.633" style="s2">make you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.633" end="01:03:25.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try.</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.633" end="01:03:25.933" style="s2">A client requested you for an urgent</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.133" end="01:03:27.633" style="s2">project.</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.933" end="01:03:28.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have school pickup. Reassign it or</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.633" end="01:03:31.633" style="s2">move the deadline.</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.733" end="01:03:34.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The client refuses anyone else.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.633" end="01:03:34.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the client Sabrina?</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.833" end="01:03:41.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I missed you. I&#39;m taking you home.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.433" end="01:03:43.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not authorized to pick us up.</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.433" end="01:03:44.933" style="s2">You&#39;re not our mom.</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.333" end="01:03:47.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once I miss Mrs. Cole, I&#39;ll send these</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.933" end="01:03:49.933" style="s2">two away. [music] Mara isn&#39;t coming. Who</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.433" end="01:03:49.933" style="s2">says?</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.433" end="01:03:55.833" style="s2">I thought you left. Used a fake project</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.633" end="01:03:57.333" style="s2">to delay me then tried to remove</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.833" end="01:03:58.933" style="s2">children you are not authorized to pick</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.333" end="01:04:00.733" style="s2">up. The school is documenting this. I</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.933" end="01:04:03.233" style="s2">only wanted to see them. You saw them.</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.733" end="01:04:03.233" style="s2">We&#39;re leaving.</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.233" end="01:04:07.233" style="s2">I need you to do something.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.333" end="01:04:14.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you take tomorrow off?</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.333" end="01:04:17.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.133" end="01:04:17.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Leo and Lily&#39;s birthday.</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.333" end="01:04:23.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow? I haven&#39;t bought gifts.</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.533" end="01:04:24.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I [snorts] planned something for all of</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.533" end="01:04:25.933" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.333" end="01:04:27.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A beach day, a licensed boat tour, and</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.933" end="01:04:27.933" style="s2">supervised snorkeling. How did you get</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.433" end="01:04:29.533" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.933" end="01:04:30.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My company raffle. I got lucky.</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.533" end="01:04:31.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you handle the kids. I&#39;ll pack.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.833" end="01:04:33.769" style="s2">Tomorrow will be perfect.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.749" end="01:04:33.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.533" end="01:04:39.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello?</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.433" end="01:04:40.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You again.</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.533" end="01:04:42.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come tomorrow if you want to see your</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.733" end="01:04:44.233" style="s2">twins on their birthday.</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.533" end="01:04:47.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send proof they&#39;re safe, then I&#39;ll come</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.233" end="01:04:49.333" style="s2">to a public place.</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.033" end="01:04:50.533" style="s2">Ethan, take them first. I may be late.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.333" end="01:04:51.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What changed?</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.533" end="01:04:53.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek says the client project can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.933" end="01:04:55.733" style="s2">wait. I &#39;ll come as soon as I &#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.933" end="01:04:58.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Please come.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.733" end="01:04:58.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.333" end="01:05:04.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why was Mara denied leave?</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.233" end="01:05:06.033" style="s2">I don&#39;t see a leave request or urgent</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.833" end="01:05:07.733" style="s2">assignment.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.033" end="01:05:10.633" style="s2">I&#39;ll ask HR to preserve the records and</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.733" end="01:05:10.633" style="s2">contact her directly.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.233" end="01:05:16.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come soon.</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.433" end="01:05:18.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.433" end="01:05:18.933" style="s2">Have fun.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.435" end="01:05:30.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are the twins?</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.835" end="01:05:30.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll come when we&#39;re done talking.</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.035" end="01:05:35.135" style="s2">Have you reconsidered marrying me?</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.335" end="01:05:36.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am already married. If you have</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.135" end="01:05:38.935" style="s2">evidence about the children, give it to</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.435" end="01:05:38.935" style="s2">my lawyer.</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.935" end="01:05:45.735" style="s2">The camera saw it, and I&#39;m reporting</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.535" end="01:05:45.735" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.135" end="01:05:49.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sun is going down. Where is she?</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.635" end="01:05:56.135" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.535" end="01:06:03.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.335" end="01:06:06.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the twins&#39; birthday. I wanted to</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.835" end="01:06:06.335" style="s2">celebrate.</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.335" end="01:06:11.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They already have their mother coming.</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.435" end="01:06:12.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve waited nearby all day. I stayed</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.435" end="01:06:15.435" style="s2">away while Mara was coming, but she</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.935" end="01:06:15.435" style="s2">isn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.935" end="01:06:24.535" style="s2">She chose him over the birthday.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.235" end="01:06:27.135" style="s2">Let me stay so the children have a</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.535" end="01:06:27.135" style="s2">mother here.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.635" end="01:06:33.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kids, do you want her here?</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.735" end="01:06:35.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you asking? We don&#39;t even have a</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.535" end="01:06:37.435" style="s2">DNA result. One story and one watch do</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.835" end="01:06:38.335" style="s2">not make her our mother.</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.435" end="01:06:38.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. I should have said that</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.335" end="01:06:41.535" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.935" end="01:06:41.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally.</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.135" end="01:06:46.835" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.535" end="01:06:57.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made it.</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.735" end="01:07:00.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Barely.</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.935" end="01:07:02.935" style="s2">Someone tried to steal my afternoon</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.035" end="01:07:06.035" style="s2">and then my family.</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.935" end="01:07:06.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one is taking your family.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.235" end="01:07:15.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know this was wrong,</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.635" end="01:07:17.735" style="s2">but I couldn&#39;t bear the children</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.435" end="01:07:19.035" style="s2">having no mother at their birthday.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.735" end="01:07:21.035" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.035" end="01:07:23.736" style="s2">There is no verified parenthood, and the</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.035" end="01:07:25.536" style="s2">children said no.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.736" end="01:07:27.936" style="s2">Their answer matters.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.536" end="01:07:30.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We want Mara.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.936" end="01:07:30.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan?</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.736" end="01:07:33.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She leaves until the test and safety</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.136" end="01:07:37.136" style="s2">review are complete.</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.936" end="01:07:37.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I&#39;ll go.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.736" end="01:07:45.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Happy birthday, my love.</p>
<p begin="01:07:43.736" end="01:07:47.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I have to marry Gavin just to reach</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.536" end="01:07:49.736" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.236" end="01:07:49.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are those?</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.036" end="01:07:54.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Matching birth lockets I bought before</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.736" end="01:07:56.436" style="s2">my twins were born.</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.536" end="01:07:57.136" style="s2">Thank you for everything, but maybe we</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.436" end="01:07:58.336" style="s2">should</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.136" end="01:08:00.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t finish that because someone</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.336" end="01:08:02.436" style="s2">threatened you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.536" end="01:08:05.136" style="s2">Tell me the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.436" end="01:08:05.136" style="s2">May I kiss you?</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.036" end="01:08:11.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you do?</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.536" end="01:08:12.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing to betray her.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.136" end="01:08:14.736" style="s2">But I may have missed what she&#39;s afraid</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.536" end="01:08:18.836" style="s2">to tell me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.736" end="01:08:18.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she leaves, we go with her.</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.936" end="01:08:23.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would a woman suddenly consider</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.436" end="01:08:25.336" style="s2">divorce?</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.736" end="01:08:27.336" style="s2">Don&#39;t invent a rival.</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.336" end="01:08:31.136" style="s2">Ask what she&#39;s afraid of. Tell the full</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.336" end="01:08:31.136" style="s2">truth and listen to the answer.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.336" end="01:08:35.436" style="s2">You think Mara has someone else?</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.336" end="01:08:37.536" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.436" end="01:08:39.336" style="s2">I was wrong to speculate.</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.536" end="01:08:40.136" style="s2">The cafe footage shows a man touching</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.336" end="01:08:43.336" style="s2">her</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.136" end="01:08:43.336" style="s2">after she told him to stop.</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.136" end="01:08:53.036" style="s2">Gavin Price,</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.236" end="01:08:54.736" style="s2">the cafe preserved video of you touching</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.036" end="01:08:57.336" style="s2">Mara without consent and staging a</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.736" end="01:08:57.336" style="s2">photograph.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.136" end="01:09:05.136" style="s2">Do not contact or approach her.</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.536" end="01:09:07.636" style="s2">Further violations go to the court and</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.136" end="01:09:07.636" style="s2">police.</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.136" end="01:09:11.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.436" end="01:09:13.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara&#39;s husband brought lawyers and</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.836" end="01:09:15.536" style="s2">police evidence.</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.736" end="01:09:17.636" style="s2">I&#39;m done going near her.</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.536" end="01:09:19.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t approach her.</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.636" end="01:09:22.436" style="s2">Make her come to you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.836" end="01:09:24.136" style="s2">Tell her the daughter has leukemia</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.436" end="01:09:26.536" style="s2">and only you</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.136" end="01:09:26.737" style="s2">are an HLA match.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.536" end="01:09:28.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.737" end="01:09:30.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; her daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.137" end="01:09:32.938" style="s2">And that is medical fraud.</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.438" end="01:09:36.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $200,000.</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.938" end="01:09:36.438" style="s2">I&#39;ll arrange the children and paperwork.</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.038" end="01:09:40.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man who touched you,</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.737" end="01:09:42.038" style="s2">did he threaten you?</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.737" end="01:09:43.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You thought I wanted him?</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.038" end="01:09:46.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For one stupid minute, tell me the real</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.838" end="01:09:46.938" style="s2">reason you mentioned divorce.</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.538" end="01:09:54.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gavin claims he is the man from that</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.338" end="01:09:56.238" style="s2">night and has my missing twins.</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.938" end="01:09:58.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you thought marrying him was the</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.238" end="01:10:01.637" style="s2">only way to reach them?</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.538" end="01:10:01.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was considering it.</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.738" end="01:10:07.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And where do I fit?</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.438" end="01:10:09.038" style="s2">I have been beside you through</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.137" end="01:10:10.637" style="s2">everything, and you were going to trade</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.038" end="01:10:14.038" style="s2">yourself</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.637" end="01:10:14.038" style="s2">without trusting me with the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.973" end="01:10:16.993" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.438" end="01:10:20.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re your children, too.</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.438" end="01:10:25.738" style="s2">Please don&#39;t leave us.</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.238" end="01:10:34.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were going to divorce Ethan and</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.137" end="01:10:34.938" style="s2">marry Gavin for access to the children?</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.338" end="01:10:39.538" style="s2">He says he controls access.</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.738" end="01:10:40.518" style="s2">I know it&#39;s wrong, but I can&#39;t abandon</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.538" end="01:10:42.538" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.518" end="01:10:42.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.038" end="01:10:46.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You also can&#39;t hand yourself to an</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.538" end="01:10:49.838" style="s2">extortionist.</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.338" end="01:10:49.838" style="s2">We verify everything first.</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.438" end="01:10:55.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Decide soon. The girl you call Anna may</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.938" end="01:10:57.038" style="s2">not have long.</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.838" end="01:10:59.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.038" end="01:11:01.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come see for yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.438" end="01:11:03.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This says leukemia.</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.637" end="01:11:05.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She allegedly needs an HLA match stem</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.738" end="01:11:07.137" style="s2">cell donor.</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.038" end="01:11:10.338" style="s2">Gavin says he matched.</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.137" end="01:11:12.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marry me and I donate.</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.338" end="01:11:15.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she is your child, this demand is</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.238" end="01:11:15.137" style="s2">monstrous.</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.038" end="01:11:23.538" style="s2">Test me through an accredited lab and</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.838" end="01:11:23.538" style="s2">transfer her records to a real hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.139" end="01:11:36.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I match?</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.339" end="01:11:36.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:11:36.849" end="01:11:38.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.939" end="01:11:44.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want to care for her, why pretend</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.239" end="01:11:46.839" style="s2">you cooked and cleaned?</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.939" end="01:11:47.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I can&#39;t cook,</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.839" end="01:11:48.839" style="s2">and I wanted one thing to look</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.939" end="01:11:50.139" style="s2">competent.</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.839" end="01:11:51.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s still lying.</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.139" end="01:11:54.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.339" end="01:11:54.739" style="s2">I tell her the truth when she walks in.</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.539" end="01:12:18.639" style="s2">I hired help for the cleaning and</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.839" end="01:12:21.139" style="s2">dinner.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.639" end="01:12:22.339" style="s2">I wanted to make tonight easier,</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.139" end="01:12:24.039" style="s2">but I should not pretend I did it</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.339" end="01:12:26.839" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.039" end="01:12:26.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We should divorce.</p>
<p begin="01:12:27.639" end="01:12:30.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t about [clears throat] dinner,</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.439" end="01:12:30.739" style="s2">is it?</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.939" end="01:12:39.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It isn&#39;t that.</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.639" end="01:12:40.639" style="s2">Gavin showed me a girl he claims is</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.139" end="01:12:42.439" style="s2">Anna.</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.639" end="01:12:44.639" style="s2">The papers say leukemia.</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.439" end="01:12:48.339" style="s2">He says only he matches,</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.639" end="01:12:48.339" style="s2">and he will donate if I marry him.</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.539" end="01:12:52.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man forged a photograph and violated</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.439" end="01:12:54.839" style="s2">a no contact demand.</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.139" end="01:12:56.139" style="s2">His medical claim cannot be trusted.</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.839" end="01:12:58.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know,</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.139" end="01:13:00.739" style="s2">but until a real hospital disproves it,</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.539" end="01:13:02.739" style="s2">I can&#39;t risk a child&#39;s life.</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.739" end="01:13:04.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust me for 24 hours.</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.739" end="01:13:08.239" style="s2">We&#39;ll verify the lab, the doctor, the</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.739" end="01:13:08.239" style="s2">diagnosis, and the children.</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.339" end="01:13:14.239" style="s2">And I need to tell you who I really am.</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.339" end="01:13:15.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for loving us.</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.239" end="01:13:18.139" style="s2">But if that child is mine, I cannot</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.739" end="01:13:20.639" style="s2">abandon her.</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.139" end="01:13:20.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.739" end="01:13:33.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You packed for</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.040" end="01:13:35.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.940" end="01:13:38.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We choose Mara.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.840" end="01:13:42.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you divorce, we stay with her. So,</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.540" end="01:13:42.540" style="s2">Mr. Cole, you can leave.</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.851" end="01:13:49.871" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.140" end="01:14:02.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wife and children actually sent you</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.840" end="01:14:04.140" style="s2">out?</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.040" end="01:14:06.440" style="s2">How do I fix this?</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.140" end="01:14:07.640" style="s2">Verify the medical story, tell her your</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.440" end="01:14:09.340" style="s2">identity,</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.640" end="01:14:11.340" style="s2">and give her facts instead of another</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.340" end="01:14:13.940" style="s2">promise.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.340" end="01:14:17.040" style="s2">If she learns how long I lied,</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.940" end="01:14:17.040" style="s2">she may never forgive me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.840" end="01:14:29.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.940" end="01:14:29.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard Mara wants a divorce.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.540" end="01:14:34.340" style="s2">I have always cared about you. Let me be</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.540" end="01:14:36.740" style="s2">there for you and the kids.</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.340" end="01:14:39.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am married.</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.740" end="01:14:42.140" style="s2">Do not turn my family&#39;s crisis into an</p>
<p begin="01:14:39.140" end="01:14:45.840" style="s2">opening for yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.140" end="01:14:45.840" style="s2">Noah, please see her out.</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.140" end="01:14:59.040" style="s2">Sabrina tried to use our separation.</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.640" end="01:15:01.740" style="s2">I sent her away.</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.040" end="01:15:01.740" style="s2">No secrets.</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.940" end="01:15:08.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will they like these cookies?</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.140" end="01:15:10.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they come home, do we still get</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.140" end="01:15:12.340" style="s2">bedtime stories?</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.640" end="01:15:14.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every one of my children gets a place</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.340" end="01:15:17.240" style="s2">beside me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.140" end="01:15:17.240" style="s2">Love does not run out.</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.587" end="01:15:19.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.740" end="01:15:27.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eli,</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.440" end="01:15:30.140" style="s2">I do not want to lie to her anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.040" end="01:15:32.540" style="s2">I&#39;m Leo, and this is my sister, Lily.</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.140" end="01:15:34.940" style="s2">What is your name?</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.540" end="01:15:34.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maisy</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.842" end="01:15:40.142" style="s2">Gavin called you Anna Price.</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.942" end="01:15:43.242" style="s2">Why is your name different?</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.142" end="01:15:43.242" style="s2">Because Gavin is not</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.142" end="01:16:02.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me an hour.</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.442" end="01:16:05.542" style="s2">Counsel will verify guardianship and the</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.242" end="01:16:05.542" style="s2">clinic records lawfully.</p>
<p begin="01:16:15.542" end="01:16:20.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You cannot walk in without permission.</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.842" end="01:16:20.942" style="s2">Mayor is inside.</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.542" end="01:16:30.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you mute me?</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.842" end="01:16:33.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo did.</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.942" end="01:16:35.242" style="s2">Your admirer can have the notifications.</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.542" end="01:16:38.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is no admirer.</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.242" end="01:16:40.242" style="s2">I sent Sabrina away.</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.242" end="01:16:42.042" style="s2">Please do not end our marriage because a</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.242" end="01:16:43.842" style="s2">criminal gave you a deadline.</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.042" end="01:16:47.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am safe here.</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.842" end="01:16:47.042" style="s2">What I need is proof.</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.942" end="01:16:52.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I help you to urgent care?</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.842" end="01:16:55.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may help me walk.</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.442" end="01:16:55.242" style="s2">No carrying.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.342" end="01:17:02.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A mild sprain.</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.042" end="01:17:04.242" style="s2">Ice, compression, and rest. Return if</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.542" end="01:17:06.742" style="s2">pain or swelling worsens.</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.242" end="01:17:09.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you it was minor.</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.742" end="01:17:10.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I worry because I love you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.142" end="01:17:13.242" style="s2">But worry does not give me the right to</p>
<p begin="01:17:10.442" end="01:17:13.242" style="s2">decide for you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.742" end="01:17:18.842" style="s2">I have been honest about other women,</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.942" end="01:17:18.842" style="s2">but not about myself.</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.942" end="01:17:23.642" style="s2">If we have any chance, you deserve the</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.042" end="01:17:23.642" style="s2">whole truth.</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.242" end="01:17:34.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maisy Parker is not Anna Price.</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.942" end="01:17:36.042" style="s2">Noah found her parents, and Gavin has no</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.342" end="01:17:36.343" style="s2">children.</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.042" end="01:17:37.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Counsel</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.343" end="01:17:39.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; confirmed it through lawful public</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.743" end="01:17:40.943" style="s2">records.</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.143" end="01:17:43.243" style="s2">The clinic cannot verify the lab report</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.943" end="01:17:45.943" style="s2">it gave Mara.</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.243" end="01:17:45.943" style="s2">You asked to see me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.043" end="01:17:51.043" style="s2">Did you finally come to your senses?</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.743" end="01:17:53.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You used two vulnerable children</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.043" end="01:17:55.443" style="s2">and forged a medical emergency to coerce</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.343" end="01:17:57.443" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.443" end="01:17:59.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maisy&#39;s parents are cooperating. The lab</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.443" end="01:18:02.943" style="s2">report is false. This conversation is</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.843" end="01:18:05.043" style="s2">being documented with everyone&#39;s notice.</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.943" end="01:18:08.543" style="s2">You cannot prove I planned it.</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.043" end="01:18:08.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell the detective who did.</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.943" end="01:18:17.643" style="s2">Sabrina Hale paid me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.143" end="01:18:19.643" style="s2">She arranged the children, the clinic,</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.643" end="01:18:21.243" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.643" end="01:18:24.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put that in a signed statement and give</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.243" end="01:18:24.343" style="s2">police every message.</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.343" end="01:18:37.543" style="s2">Gavin gave the police the payment trail</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.543" end="01:18:37.543" style="s2">and your messages.</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.943" end="01:18:40.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do not know what you are talking</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.143" end="01:18:42.343" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.043" end="01:18:44.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The detective does.</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.343" end="01:18:45.743" style="s2">Do not contact Mara or the children</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.043" end="01:18:47.043" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.743" end="01:18:49.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.043" end="01:18:51.243" style="s2">I built the story,</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.543" end="01:18:52.443" style="s2">but I am still the twins&#39; biological</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.243" end="01:18:53.943" style="s2">mother,</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.443" end="01:18:56.143" style="s2">and I know where Mara&#39;s missing children</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.943" end="01:18:56.143" style="s2">are.</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.243" end="01:18:59.843" style="s2">Where are they?</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.943" end="01:19:02.043" style="s2">Convince Ethan to marry me and I tell</p>
<p begin="01:18:59.843" end="01:19:02.043" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.743" end="01:19:05.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.343" end="01:19:07.243" style="s2">You do not get a marriage in exchange</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.743" end="01:19:10.343" style="s2">for a child&#39;s safety.</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.243" end="01:19:10.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then find them without me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.143" end="01:19:23.243" style="s2">Ethan, do you love me?</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.043" end="01:19:31.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.343" end="01:19:32.943" style="s2">I love you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.343" end="01:19:34.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then would you ever marry Sabrina to get</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.943" end="01:19:35.943" style="s2">my children back?</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.343" end="01:19:37.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.943" end="01:19:40.344" style="s2">Because I love you,</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.743" end="01:19:42.244" style="s2">I will not turn our into currency.</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.344" end="01:19:44.545" style="s2">We will find them without surrendering</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.244" end="01:19:47.144" style="s2">either of our lives.</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.545" end="01:19:47.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.244" end="01:19:52.945" style="s2">Have you decided?</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.344" end="01:19:57.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.344" end="01:20:00.445" style="s2">I refuse. I want the truth, but I do not</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.445" end="01:20:00.445" style="s2">own Ethan&#39;s life.</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.860" end="01:20:03.880" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.945" end="01:20:09.244" style="s2">Eleanor Cole is meeting Mara today.</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.344" end="01:20:11.344" style="s2">If she sees her, the old maternity lie</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.244" end="01:20:14.945" style="s2">could collapse.</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.344" end="01:20:14.945" style="s2">Then Mara never reaches Eleanor.</p>
<p begin="01:20:17.644" end="01:20:22.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My grandmother can be direct, but she</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.644" end="01:20:22.744" style="s2">has wanted to meet you for years.</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.445" end="01:20:26.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not nervous.</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.230" end="01:20:39.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.344" end="01:20:54.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.344" end="01:20:57.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m okay.</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.945" end="01:20:59.344" style="s2">We hid this because Lily thought you</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.545" end="01:21:02.744" style="s2">might see her as a monster.</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.344" end="01:21:02.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A monster? Never.</p>
<p begin="01:21:18.545" end="01:21:21.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The women in my mother&#39;s line are born</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.945" end="01:21:24.844" style="s2">unusually strong.</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.545" end="01:21:26.244" style="s2">It passes from mother to daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.844" end="01:21:28.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then Lily may be your biological</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.244" end="01:21:28.644" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.945" end="01:21:36.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does it say?</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.545" end="01:21:41.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The accredited test supports maternity</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.344" end="01:21:41.144" style="s2">for both children at greater than 99.99%</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.146" end="01:21:48.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo and Lily are the twins I lost?</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.745" end="01:21:50.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.946" end="01:21:51.646" style="s2">They&#39;re your children.</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.446" end="01:21:54.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:21:51.646" end="01:21:54.245" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.451" end="01:22:00.471" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.646" end="01:22:16.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.546" end="01:22:20.546" style="s2">Five years ago, someone drugged both of</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.546" end="01:22:22.546" style="s2">us at that hotel.</p>
<p begin="01:22:20.546" end="01:22:24.446" style="s2">Neither of us could consent.</p>
<p begin="01:22:22.546" end="01:22:27.446" style="s2">Eleanor was later given the twins and</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.446" end="01:22:28.745" style="s2">told me you died in childbirth.</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.446" end="01:22:31.646" style="s2">I believed it,</p>
<p begin="01:22:28.745" end="01:22:31.646" style="s2">so I never searched for you.</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.845" end="01:22:35.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I forgive you for not knowing.</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.345" end="01:22:38.446" style="s2">I do not forgive the people who built</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.845" end="01:22:38.446" style="s2">that lie.</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.046" end="01:22:42.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Police found the truck driver.</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.046" end="01:22:43.646" style="s2">Payment records connect the crash to</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.345" end="01:22:44.946" style="s2">Sabrina.</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.646" end="01:22:46.646" style="s2">She&#39;s been arrested while the</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.946" end="01:22:49.446" style="s2">investigation continues.</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.646" end="01:22:49.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She chose this.</p>
<p begin="01:23:01.946" end="01:23:05.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you do to my daughter?</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.446" end="01:23:07.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sabrina was arrested in connection with</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.046" end="01:23:10.046" style="s2">an attempted vehicle assault. Evidence,</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.345" end="01:23:11.745" style="s2">not I, put her there.</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.046" end="01:23:14.745" style="s2">You hate lies?</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.745" end="01:23:17.546" style="s2">Then ask your husband why Ethan Cole,</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.745" end="01:23:21.146" style="s2">CEO of Apex Meridian Group,</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.546" end="01:23:21.146" style="s2">let you believe he was only a driver.</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.046" end="01:23:25.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan Cole?</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.946" end="01:23:27.745" style="s2">You&#39;ve been the CEO all along?</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.946" end="01:23:29.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara, I can explain.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.745" end="01:23:32.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apex headquarters,</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.946" end="01:23:34.345" style="s2">the gala,</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.245" end="01:23:36.345" style="s2">your parents&#39; gifts.</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.345" end="01:23:38.745" style="s2">I should have seen it. Men that rich</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.345" end="01:23:41.245" style="s2">protect every dollar.</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.745" end="01:23:43.946" style="s2">He hid it because he never trusted you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.245" end="01:23:44.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is not true.</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.946" end="01:23:47.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Security,</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.947" end="01:23:50.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; escort Ms. Hale out.</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.547" end="01:23:50.747" style="s2">No force unless necessary.</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.047" end="01:24:04.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, she was wrong about the money.</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.147" end="01:24:07.547" style="s2">Dad did lie, but there is one document</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.847" end="01:24:07.547" style="s2">you need to see.</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.147" end="01:24:12.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this?</p>
<p begin="01:24:10.747" end="01:24:15.247" style="s2">An offer to place the marital assets and</p>
<p begin="01:24:12.947" end="01:24:17.247" style="s2">Ethan&#39;s Apex voting rights into a family</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.247" end="01:24:18.447" style="s2">trust</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.247" end="01:24:20.147" style="s2">for me and the children?</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.447" end="01:24:22.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The lawyers drafted it at my request.</p>
<p begin="01:24:20.147" end="01:24:23.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Money was never the wound.</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.247" end="01:24:25.847" style="s2">The lie was.</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.947" end="01:24:27.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I gave you my real name,</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.847" end="01:24:29.147" style="s2">but let you believe I was a driver.</p>
<p begin="01:24:27.947" end="01:24:30.647" style="s2">I was afraid you&#39;d see the fortune</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.147" end="01:24:32.647" style="s2">before you saw me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.647" end="01:24:35.247" style="s2">Then I met you, and every day I delayed</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.647" end="01:24:37.047" style="s2">became another lie.</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.247" end="01:24:39.247" style="s2">That was cowardly.</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.047" end="01:24:41.847" style="s2">I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.247" end="01:24:43.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not signing away my anger, and I am</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.847" end="01:24:46.347" style="s2">not throwing you out.</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.847" end="01:24:48.247" style="s2">We rebuild slowly</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.347" end="01:24:49.547" style="s2">with no more hidden lives or decisions</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.247" end="01:24:51.647" style="s2">made for me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:49.547" end="01:24:53.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Agreed.</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.647" end="01:24:55.547" style="s2">And when you are ready, may I give you</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.247" end="01:24:57.447" style="s2">the wedding we never had?</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.547" end="01:25:00.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We want to be in it,</p>
<p begin="01:24:57.447" end="01:25:00.147" style="s2">both of us.</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.853" end="01:25:03.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell and music]</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.447" end="01:25:11.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I finally get to see my son&#39;s wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:25:24.347" end="01:25:28.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more hiding who I am.</p>
<p begin="01:25:26.247" end="01:25:30.147" style="s2">No decisions made for you.</p>
<p begin="01:25:28.547" end="01:25:31.747" style="s2">Truth.</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.147" end="01:25:32.947" style="s2">I choose the truth, especially when it</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.747" end="01:25:35.847" style="s2">scares me.</p>
<p begin="01:25:32.947" end="01:25:37.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No sacrificing myself in silence.</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.847" end="01:25:39.947" style="s2">I choose you as my partner,</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.947" end="01:25:41.947" style="s2">not my rescuer.</p>
<p begin="01:25:39.947" end="01:25:45.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may kiss Mom now.</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.947" end="01:25:47.759" style="s2">She said yes. We checked.</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.739" end="01:25:47.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.549" end="01:26:01.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
